Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":785,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1858303,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":271520,"Name":"chel","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271520.jpg?_r=1449751825","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1404566777,"LastPoster":{"Id":286436,"Name":"IreneErika","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286436.jpg?_r=1457727933","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1858303,"PostDate":1404566777,"PostContent":"I have just been informed that Matey no longer works at the Jellyfish restaurant. \u00a0 Ive already b...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"topbanana1985@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"94.14.35.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373780897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271520.jpg?_r=1449751825","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chel","Id":271520,"Name":"chel","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"94.14.35.71","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8629bbb8aada0fbc3a9f1870ac1c9b16","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have just been informed that Matey no longer works at the Jellyfish restaurant.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ive already booked, planned, arranged and paid my deposit for the Jellyfish, but now Matey tells me she is now working at the Huracan cafe instead.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Im a bit worried at what this means for my wedding, especially with regards to date, time, deposit paid already, Huracan prices and if we can still have all the same things as we had planned at the Jellyfish.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our wedding is\/was booked at the Jellyfish for the 25th September, so not too much longer to go now.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone else had this change of venue situation?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858303,"PostDate":1404566777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have just been informed that Matey no longer works at the Jellyfish restaurant.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ive already booked, planned, arranged and paid my deposit for the Jellyfish, but now Matey tells me she is now working at the Huracan cafe instead.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Im a bit worried at what this means for my wedding, especially with regards to date, time, deposit paid already, Huracan prices and if we can still have all the same things as we had planned at the Jellyfish.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our wedding is\/was booked at the Jellyfish for the 25th September, so not too much longer to go now.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone else had this change of venue situation?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"topbanana1985@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"94.14.35.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373780897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271520.jpg?_r=1449751825","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chel","Id":271520,"Name":"chel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.248.236.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0aec8d04d8cedcc4cb3ee5b98f679b19","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Did you have your wedding? How was it?? Did everything go as planned? I was thinking of booking for next July at Jellyfish and was hoping for some recent input\/reviews.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope it was a magical day!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876056,"PostDate":1413581932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Did you have your wedding? How was it?? Did everything go as planned? I was thinking of booking for next July at Jellyfish and was hoping for some recent input\/reviews.<\/p>\n<p>Hope it was a magical day!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"linda_pop_3@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"67.204.52.109","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408702062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mllelinda","Id":279528,"Name":"mllelinda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.11.246.229","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d85dae1070256113b9b46dc4d2c1144","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mllelinda\" post=\"1876056\" timestamp=\"1413599932\"]\nDid you have your wedding? How was it?? Did everything go as planned? I was thinking of booking for next July at Jellyfish and was hoping for some recent input\/reviews.\nHope it was a magical day!![\/quote]Have you heard back from anyone regarding the Jellyfish?   I am also wondering what management is like there now that Matye is gone.  Who is the planner and who is your point of contact?","Attachments":[],"Id":1911692,"PostDate":1457529853,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>mllelinda, on 17 October 2014 - 09:38 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Did you have your wedding? How was it?? Did everything go as planned? I was thinking of booking for next July at Jellyfish and was hoping for some recent input\/reviews.<\/p>\n<p>Hope it was a magical day!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Have you heard back from anyone regarding the Jellyfish? \u00a0 I am also wondering what management is like there now that Matye is gone. \u00a0Who is the planner and who is your point of contact?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkleopartini@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.11.246.229","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1457369135,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286436.jpg?_r=1457727933","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"IreneErika","Id":286436,"Name":"IreneErika","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77475","Title":"Little Worried, Jellyfish\/huracan","LastPostDate":1457529853},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
