{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b83e6ccb8666514648869103cc43b43","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ive seen them... WOW! your wedding was stunning, the best i have seen. Loved the pics you organised it to perfection :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1765474,"PostDate":1370579988,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ive seen them... WOW! your wedding was stunning, the best i have seen. Loved the pics you organised it to perfection :-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amyevans_5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"84.93.51.41","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367308245,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269144.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AMYEVANS","Id":269144,"Name":"AMYEVANS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ccf1302d34e09038e23ce4bcf6993484","RawContent":"@Paolalindsay, did you go with the resort photographer WBA or did you hire an outside company? What have you ladies decided on photographers? My wedding is in January and I&#039;m still undecided on what to do.","Attachments":[],"Id":1766284,"PostDate":1370815023,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @Paolalindsay, did you go with the resort photographer WBA or did you hire an outside company? What have you ladies decided on photographers? My wedding is in January and I'm still undecided on what to do.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357849978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13df8c0274eae96f799fe46bfceeef10","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Kristina -&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We decided to go with a different photographer because WBA seemed like they did more \"posing\" type photography and we were looking for more creative, artistic. &amp;nbsp;Their prices were also much more expensive in regards to packages and included a lot of what we did not want (i.e. actual photos, cards, videos, etc.) However, WBA is part of our wedding package so we hired Karina Jensen (http:\/\/photobykarina.com)&amp;nbsp;to photograph our entire wedding and WBA will do our ceremony or whatever our Divine Package includes. &amp;nbsp;We had tried to book Katya Nova because of the great reviews, but she is out of the country from Nov 2013- Feb 2014. &amp;nbsp;She gave us a list of great photographers she recommended such Desy &amp;amp; Vincent of RF Weddings, Cole &amp;amp; Jakob of Nordica Photography, Anna from Cineart.ca, Candice from Popik Photography, Karina Jensen (we are using her), Jess Shields Photography, Tamara Briggs Photography (password: dwedding) Yury Meleshko, Asia Pimentel, and Mel &amp;amp; Rob &amp;nbsp;Shoebox Photography. &amp;nbsp;Google them and check out their websites! &amp;nbsp;All look like incredible photographers just a matter of what your budget is and what you are looking for. &amp;nbsp;They all vary in their style.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good Luck :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; p.s. be ware that Now Larmiar now charges a $500 fee to allow an outside photographer into the resort - it may be less expensive to book a room for the photographer since they will then be a guest at the resort...not something I have looked into just yet.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1766412,"PostDate":1370864648,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Kristina -<\/p> <p> We decided to go with a different photographer because WBA seemed like they did more \"posing\" type photography and we were looking for more creative, artistic. \u00a0Their prices were also much more expensive in regards to packages and included a lot of what we did not want (i.e. actual photos, cards, videos, etc.) However, WBA is part of our wedding package so we hired Karina Jensen (<a href='http:\/\/photobykarina.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/photobykarina.com<\/a>)\u00a0to photograph our entire wedding and WBA will do our ceremony or whatever our Divine Package includes. \u00a0We had tried to book Katya Nova because of the great reviews, but she is out of the country from Nov 2013- Feb 2014. \u00a0She gave us a list of great photographers she recommended such Desy & Vincent of RF Weddings, Cole & Jakob of Nordica Photography, Anna from Cineart.ca, Candice from Popik Photography, Karina Jensen (we are using her), Jess Shields Photography, Tamara Briggs Photography (password: dwedding) Yury Meleshko, Asia Pimentel, and Mel & Rob \u00a0Shoebox Photography. \u00a0Google them and check out their websites! \u00a0All look like incredible photographers just a matter of what your budget is and what you are looking for. \u00a0They all vary in their style.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good Luck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> p.s. be ware that Now Larmiar now charges a $500 fee to allow an outside photographer into the resort - it may be less expensive to book a room for the photographer since they will then be a guest at the resort...not something I have looked into just yet.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlstockslager@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.59.10.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369168942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269825.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jldinapoli","Id":269825,"Name":"jldinapoli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dff708ec27541b0304893b16bd06db6e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Kristina Simms[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n @Paolalindsay, did you go with the resort photographer WBA or did you hire an outside company?\n \n What have you ladies decided on photographers? My wedding is in January and I&#039;m still undecided on what to do.[\/quote] \n Now Larimar does have a resort photography team, but they can be hit &amp;amp; miss. If you really care about your wedding photos, hire someone whose work you LOVE, so that there are no disappointments. I would offer you our services, but we&#039;re out of the country till March 2014... Check out &#039;photographers&#039; in the &#039;vendor&#039; section here on BDW and compare portfolios!!  \n \n Hugs from sunny Punta Cana and best of luck on your amazing Big Day,  \n \n Katya.","Attachments":[],"Id":1766557,"PostDate":1370883185,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Kristina Simms<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> @Paolalindsay, did you go with the resort photographer WBA or did you hire an outside company?<br \/> <br \/> What have you ladies decided on photographers? My wedding is in January and I'm still undecided on what to do.<\/blockquote> <p> Now Larimar does have a resort photography team, but they can be hit & miss. If you really care about your wedding photos, hire someone whose work you LOVE, so that there are no disappointments. I would offer you our services, but we're out of the country till March 2014... Check out 'photographers' in the 'vendor' section here on BDW and compare portfolios!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hugs from sunny Punta Cana and best of luck on your amazing Big Day,\u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> Katya.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kzheleznova@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"61.19.236.122","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1261894145,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224102.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyaNova","Id":224102,"Name":"KatyaNova","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8e10789f078cad347537b92387cd578","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Kristina Simms[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n @Paolalindsay, did you go with the resort photographer WBA or did you hire an outside company?\n \n What have you ladies decided on photographers? My wedding is in January and I&#039;m still undecided on what to do.[\/quote] \n @Kristina,  \n \n We know that many people make us negative publicity (especially competence), but you can see some [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/g\/u\/63514\/WBA-Weddings\/photosets\/1\/\"]examples of our work[\/url] and you can decide what&#039;s best for you. Now Larimar organizes many weddings and most of the couples choose us as photographers  for their special day. They go home very pleased with with the beautiful memories that they can share with their loved ones. \n \n Sincerely, \n WBA team.","Attachments":[],"Id":1766763,"PostDate":1370942761,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Kristina Simms<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> @Paolalindsay, did you go with the resort photographer WBA or did you hire an outside company?<br \/> <br \/> What have you ladies decided on photographers? My wedding is in January and I'm still undecided on what to do.<\/blockquote> <p> @Kristina,\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We know that many people make us negative publicity (especially competence), but you can see some <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/g\/u\/63514\/WBA-Weddings\/photosets\/1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>examples of our work<\/a>\u00a0and you can decide what's best for you. Now Larimar organizes many weddings and most of the couples choose us as photographers \u00a0for their special day. They go home very pleased with with the beautiful memories that they can share with their loved ones.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sincerely,<\/p> <p> WBA team.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"weddings@wbastudio.com","IpAddress":"186.6.222.235","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1350729395,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261572.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WBA Weddings","Id":261572,"Name":"WBA Weddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59d1a9724b18a7a8b996c8010eff5398","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I will be using WBA as the pics i have seen look fab and they are all in with the price :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1766769,"PostDate":1370944294,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I will be using WBA as the pics i have seen look fab and they are all in with the price :-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amyevans_5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"84.93.51.41","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367308245,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269144.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AMYEVANS","Id":269144,"Name":"AMYEVANS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7fe43cd6b266fdb09471ae94bc2de3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have heard of other resorts in Punta Cana offering bonfires on the beach for a price, Does anyone know if this is an option at NOW Larimar? I was thinking it would be a great thing to do after the reception or rehearsal?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1766857,"PostDate":1370953596,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have heard of other resorts in Punta Cana offering bonfires on the beach for a price, Does anyone know if this is an option at NOW Larimar? I was thinking it would be a great thing to do after the reception or rehearsal?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.kemp@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365686804,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268451.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda15012014","Id":268451,"Name":"amanda15012014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea737dda300da9d25ccd6ec007f1277c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jldinapoli[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Kristina - \n We decided to go with a different photographer because WBA seemed like they did more \"posing\" type photography and we were looking for more creative, artistic.  Their prices were also much more expensive in regards to packages and included a lot of what we did not want (i.e. actual photos, cards, videos, etc.) However, WBA is part of our wedding package so we hired Karina Jensen ([url=\"http:\/\/photobykarina.com\"]http:\/\/photobykarina.com[\/url]) to photograph our entire wedding and WBA will do our ceremony or whatever our Divine Package includes.  We had tried to book Katya Nova because of the great reviews, but she is out of the country from Nov 2013- Feb 2014.  She gave us a list of great photographers she recommended such Desy &amp;amp; Vincent of RF Weddings, Cole &amp;amp; Jakob of Nordica Photography, Anna from Cineart.ca, Candice from Popik Photography, Karina Jensen (we are using her), Jess Shields Photography, Tamara Briggs Photography (password: dwedding) Yury Meleshko, Asia Pimentel, and Mel &amp;amp; Rob  Shoebox Photography.  Google them and check out their websites!  All look like incredible photographers just a matter of what your budget is and what you are looking for.  They all vary in their style. \n \n Good Luck :) \n \n p.s. be ware that Now Larmiar now charges a $500 fee to allow an outside photographer into the resort - it may be less expensive to book a room for the photographer since they will then be a guest at the resort...not something I have looked into just yet.[\/quote] \n @Jldinapoli, \n \n Just for your information- even if you will bring the photographer (local vendor) and you will book a room for him\/her in the Resort, the outside vendor fee for the photographer must be payed. \n \n Regards,","Attachments":[],"Id":1766868,"PostDate":1370954810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jldinapoli<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Kristina -<\/p> <p> We decided to go with a different photographer because WBA seemed like they did more \"posing\" type photography and we were looking for more creative, artistic. \u00a0Their prices were also much more expensive in regards to packages and included a lot of what we did not want (i.e. actual photos, cards, videos, etc.) However, WBA is part of our wedding package so we hired Karina Jensen (<a href='http:\/\/photobykarina.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/photobykarina.com<\/a>)\u00a0to photograph our entire wedding and WBA will do our ceremony or whatever our Divine Package includes. \u00a0We had tried to book Katya Nova because of the great reviews, but she is out of the country from Nov 2013- Feb 2014. \u00a0She gave us a list of great photographers she recommended such Desy & Vincent of RF Weddings, Cole & Jakob of Nordica Photography, Anna from Cineart.ca, Candice from Popik Photography, Karina Jensen (we are using her), Jess Shields Photography, Tamara Briggs Photography (password: dwedding) Yury Meleshko, Asia Pimentel, and Mel & Rob \u00a0Shoebox Photography. \u00a0Google them and check out their websites! \u00a0All look like incredible photographers just a matter of what your budget is and what you are looking for. \u00a0They all vary in their style.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good Luck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> p.s. be ware that Now Larmiar now charges a $500 fee to allow an outside photographer into the resort - it may be less expensive to book a room for the photographer since they will then be a guest at the resort...not something I have looked into just yet.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> @Jldinapoli,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just for your information- even if you will bring the photographer (local vendor) and you will book a room for him\/her in the Resort, the outside vendor fee for the photographer must be payed.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Regards,<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"weddings@wbastudio.com","IpAddress":"186.6.222.235","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1350729395,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261572.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WBA Weddings","Id":261572,"Name":"WBA Weddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1c3491487f715305922361e460b1134","RawContent":"Thanks for all the great info ladies! I will be looking at photos for a while now!","Attachments":[],"Id":1767641,"PostDate":1371075161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for all the great info ladies! I will be looking at photos for a while now!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357849978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80480260b4e13873969e08157827ca72","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jldinapoli[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Kristina - \n We decided to go with a different photographer because WBA seemed like they did more \"posing\" type photography and we were looking for more creative, artistic.  Their prices were also much more expensive in regards to packages and included a lot of what we did not want (i.e. actual photos, cards, videos, etc.) However, WBA is part of our wedding package so we hired Karina Jensen ([url=\"http:\/\/photobykarina.com\"]http:\/\/photobykarina.com[\/url]) to photograph our entire wedding and WBA will do our ceremony or whatever our Divine Package includes.  We had tried to book Katya Nova because of the great reviews, but she is out of the country from Nov 2013- Feb 2014.  She gave us a list of great photographers she recommended such Desy &amp;amp; Vincent of RF Weddings, Cole &amp;amp; Jakob of Nordica Photography, Anna from Cineart.ca, Candice from Popik Photography, Karina Jensen (we are using her), Jess Shields Photography, Tamara Briggs Photography (password: dwedding) Yury Meleshko, Asia Pimentel, and Mel &amp;amp; Rob  Shoebox Photography.  Google them and check out their websites!  All look like incredible photographers just a matter of what your budget is and what you are looking for.  They all vary in their style. \n \n Good Luck :) \n \n p.s. be ware that Now Larmiar now charges a $500 fee to allow an outside photographer into the resort - it may be less expensive to book a room for the photographer since they will then be a guest at the resort...not something I have looked into just yet.[\/quote] \n You ROCK for posting these, jldinapoli [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif[\/img] \n \n That&#039;s the list of recommendations I send to all my brides whose weddings we&#039;re not around for... Choosing a photographer is such a personal affair... You really have to make sure you love their work and they are fabulous people - because you&#039;re going to spend your entire wedding day in their presence!  \n \n Regarding the $500 outside vendor fee - mandatory and totally fair. We offer to split it with all our couples. Boom!  \n \n Hugs from Punta Cana, \n K+R","Attachments":[],"Id":1767809,"PostDate":1371116439,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jldinapoli<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Kristina -<\/p> <p> We decided to go with a different photographer because WBA seemed like they did more \"posing\" type photography and we were looking for more creative, artistic. \u00a0Their prices were also much more expensive in regards to packages and included a lot of what we did not want (i.e. actual photos, cards, videos, etc.) However, WBA is part of our wedding package so we hired Karina Jensen (<a href='http:\/\/photobykarina.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/photobykarina.com<\/a>)\u00a0to photograph our entire wedding and WBA will do our ceremony or whatever our Divine Package includes. \u00a0We had tried to book Katya Nova because of the great reviews, but she is out of the country from Nov 2013- Feb 2014. \u00a0She gave us a list of great photographers she recommended such Desy & Vincent of RF Weddings, Cole & Jakob of Nordica Photography, Anna from Cineart.ca, Candice from Popik Photography, Karina Jensen (we are using her), Jess Shields Photography, Tamara Briggs Photography (password: dwedding) Yury Meleshko, Asia Pimentel, and Mel & Rob \u00a0Shoebox Photography. \u00a0Google them and check out their websites! \u00a0All look like incredible photographers just a matter of what your budget is and what you are looking for. \u00a0They all vary in their style.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good Luck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> p.s. be ware that Now Larmiar now charges a $500 fee to allow an outside photographer into the resort - it may be less expensive to book a room for the photographer since they will then be a guest at the resort...not something I have looked into just yet.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> You ROCK for posting these, jldinapoli\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1371148675967_1329\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> That's the list of recommendations I send to all my brides whose weddings we're not around for... Choosing a photographer is such a personal affair... You really have to make sure you love their work and they are fabulous people - because you're going to spend your entire wedding day in their presence!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Regarding the $500 outside vendor fee - mandatory and totally fair. We offer to split it with all our couples. Boom!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hugs from Punta Cana,\u00a0<br \/> K+R<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kzheleznova@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"61.19.236.122","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1261894145,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224102.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyaNova","Id":224102,"Name":"KatyaNova","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
