{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75ab852d0f6384f9b9f1ad39a9840717","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Marbear0503[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n KatyaNova, \n I am planning on getting married on May 2nd or 3rd, 2014 at Now Larimar in the beautiful Punta Cana!! I am very interested in getting a photographer other than the one they provide you with at the resort. How much do you and your husband charge??[\/quote] \n Hey love!  \n Ah, I&#039;m so disappointed we&#039;ll be in Italy for a wedding and aren&#039;t coming back till May 4th... We could fly back a day earlier for you if the 4th of May works for you! Please shoot me an email katya@katyanova.com or send me a private message and we&#039;ll figure it out! xoxo","Attachments":[],"Id":1777147,"PostDate":1373471078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Marbear0503<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> KatyaNova,<\/p> <p> I am planning on getting married on May 2nd or 3rd, 2014 at Now Larimar in the beautiful Punta Cana!! I am very interested in getting a photographer other than the one they provide you with at the resort. How much do you and your husband charge??\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hey love!\u00a0<\/p> <p> Ah, I'm so disappointed we'll be in Italy for a wedding and aren't coming back till May 4th... We could fly back a day earlier for you if the 4th of May works for you! Please shoot me an email katya@katyanova.com or send me a private message and we'll figure it out! xoxo<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kzheleznova@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"61.19.236.122","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1261894145,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224102.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyaNova","Id":224102,"Name":"KatyaNova","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cab6d5ef92f060209be5f57854ff1d3b","RawContent":"@Kristina SImms Hi there. I hired an outside photographer Phil Steingard; however, I also got my free photos from my wedding package with WBA. WBA did do my VIDEO and it tirned out great","Attachments":[],"Id":1777890,"PostDate":1373633079,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @Kristina SImms Hi there. I hired an outside photographer Phil Steingard; however, I also got my free photos from my wedding package with WBA. WBA did do my VIDEO and it tirned out great\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"opa1papi@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1354821617,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263022.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Paolalindsay","Id":263022,"Name":"Paolalindsay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87b9359bcac69caabc46ba383dc7ddfd","RawContent":"We finally got a reply that our requested date of May 14, 2014 is available!!! I am so excited that we finally have an answer! I cant wait to start planning wedding details! I want to hear everyone else&#039;s plans or wedding details if it already happened(congratulations!) also please post pics!","Attachments":[],"Id":1778008,"PostDate":1373658615,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We finally got a reply that our requested date of May 14, 2014 is available!!! I am so excited that we finally have an answer! I cant wait to start planning wedding details! I want to hear everyone else's plans or wedding details if it already happened(congratulations!) also please post pics!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberk90@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372752045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271117.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberk90","Id":271117,"Name":"amberk90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"958c8e9c2b5ff2e238e3679bc042fb8f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello all, I have been looking at Now larimar punta cana and dreams la romana, Im swaying slightly towards Now.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have been looking at their wedding guide and Im a little confused with their prices, so if anyone could shed some light on the Now wedding prices I would greatly appreciate it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My confusion has come from page 11 of the wedding guide &#039;additional wedding services&#039; I see all items listed through out the guide states $ however on page 11 it shows &amp;nbsp;a few items, such as the fire dancers as US$. Does that mean that all the other prices are actually RD$\/dominican pesos $?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Or are all prices USD$?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also on another note, can anyone shed some light on the outside vendor photography fee? I have a very close friend who is also a photographer. I have invited him to the wedding as a guest and also asked him to do the photography. Since he is also going to be a wedding guest he will be staying with us at the hotel so would the outside vendor fee apply to him to do the photography?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any info on these anyone has will be greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ;-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1778293,"PostDate":1373781583,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello all, I have been looking at Now larimar punta cana and dreams la romana, Im swaying slightly towards Now.<\/p> <p> I have been looking at their wedding guide and Im a little confused with their prices, so if anyone could shed some light on the Now wedding prices I would greatly appreciate it.<\/p> <p> My confusion has come from page 11 of the wedding guide 'additional wedding services' I see all items listed through out the guide states $ however on page 11 it shows \u00a0a few items, such as the fire dancers as US$. Does that mean that all the other prices are actually RD$\/dominican pesos $?\u00a0<\/p> <p> Or are all prices USD$?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also on another note, can anyone shed some light on the outside vendor photography fee? I have a very close friend who is also a photographer. I have invited him to the wedding as a guest and also asked him to do the photography. Since he is also going to be a wedding guest he will be staying with us at the hotel so would the outside vendor fee apply to him to do the photography?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any info on these anyone has will be greatly appreciated.<\/p> <p> ;-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"topbanana1985@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"94.14.35.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373780897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271520.jpg?_r=1449751825","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chel","Id":271520,"Name":"chel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd49a603c5788100d780edeae3327d4c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]amberk90[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n We finally got a reply that our requested date of May 14, 2014 is available!!! I am so excited that we finally have an answer! I cant wait to start planning wedding details! I want to hear everyone else&#039;s plans or wedding details if it already happened(congratulations!) also please post pics![\/quote] \n CONGRATULATIONS on locking down your date, lady! The hard part is over :) Hope these pictures help you, here are a few of our latest weddings that we&#039;ve done at Now Larimar...  \n [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-lindsay-marko\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-lindsay-marko\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n [url=\"http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-jellyfish-wedding-megan-tey\/\"]http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-jellyfish-wedding-megan-tey\/[\/url][\/size][\/font] [font=Helvetica][size=3]\n Let me know if you have any questions about the place! xoxo Katya [\/size][\/font]","Attachments":[],"Id":1780770,"PostDate":1374304101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>amberk90<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> We finally got a reply that our requested date of May 14, 2014 is available!!! I am so excited that we finally have an answer! I cant wait to start planning wedding details! I want to hear everyone else's plans or wedding details if it already happened(congratulations!) also please post pics!<\/blockquote> <p> CONGRATULATIONS on locking down your date, lady! The hard part is over <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Hope these pictures help you, here are a few of our latest weddings that we've done at Now Larimar...\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-taylor-scott\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...g-taylor-scott\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/secrets-royal-beach-wedding-photographer-laura-jeff\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...her-laura-jeff\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/tamara-jeff-now-larimar-wedding-punta-cana\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...ing-punta-cana\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/samantha-travis-now-larimar-engagement-punta-cana-dr\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...-punta-cana-dr\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-jen-jack\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...dding-jen-jack\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-lindsay-marko\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...-lindsay-marko\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/now-larimar-punta-cana-jellyfish-wedding-megan-tey\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...ding-megan-tey\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: Helvetica\"> Let me know if you have any questions about the place! xoxo Katya\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kzheleznova@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"61.19.236.122","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1261894145,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224102.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyaNova","Id":224102,"Name":"KatyaNova","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3bfe7b946b8aa436533280b6dc9299b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m not sure if you are aware but if you guests stay at another resort there is a visitor pass that you or they have to purchase to attend your wedding or get on the resort. &amp;nbsp;Just an FYI&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1780860,"PostDate":1374330066,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm not sure if you are aware but if you guests stay at another resort there is a visitor pass that you or they have to purchase to attend your wedding or get on the resort. \u00a0Just an FYI<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlstockslager@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.59.10.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369168942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"