{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eca96e3eacb27f6d3d95f03843d4ffca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Is anyone using a travel agent ? Why or why not did you decide to use one?!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If anyone has any TA recommendations please send them my way! I&#039;m having a hard time finding one that works with Now resorts and isn&#039;t \"pushing\" the others on me!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1782063,"PostDate":1374588171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Is anyone using a travel agent ? Why or why not did you decide to use one?!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If anyone has any TA recommendations please send them my way! I'm having a hard time finding one that works with Now resorts and isn't \"pushing\" the others on me!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"telli26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.91.162.106","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373111270,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":139,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tiffany Ellison","Id":271235,"Name":"Tiffany Ellison","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"328dee5712d68105d380689bd3113aa2","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Marbear0503&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p&gt; Hey ladies, I am glad your getting your confirmations for your wedding dates!! i just got mine last week and it did take them just over 2 weeks to confirm. But I am now confirmed for April 28th at 5pm!! I am sooo excited!! I am trying to finish designing my wedding invites so I can send them out soon so people can put down their deposits!! It&#039;s all starting to feel so real!! I bought my wedding dress from David&#039;s Bridal on July 6th and they called me on July 18th because it was ready for pick up!! Talk about fast!!! I hope every ones planning is going great!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; Congrats on the confirmation! Where have you reserved to have your ceremony and reception?","Attachments":[],"Id":1782171,"PostDate":1374601996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Marbear0503<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p> Hey ladies, I am glad your getting your confirmations for your wedding dates!! i just got mine last week and it did take them just over 2 weeks to confirm. But I am now confirmed for April 28th at 5pm!! I am sooo excited!! I am trying to finish designing my wedding invites so I can send them out soon so people can put down their deposits!! It's all starting to feel so real!! I bought my wedding dress from David's Bridal on July 6th and they called me on July 18th because it was ready for pick up!! Talk about fast!!! I hope every ones planning is going great!!<\/p> <\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> Congrats on the confirmation! Where have you reserved to have your ceremony and reception?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22baceb9ef3c39baadbed41f30ecf1df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Tiffany Ellison: I am a travel agent and the Bride :) I can talk to my boss tomorrow and find out some information for you. I am not sure if we do groups for all parts of the US, but I will ask and see. I know we&#039;ve sent groups out of Detroit, Michigan.Do you know what day in May your going to have your wedding?!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; duchovny0901: We are having our ceremony on the beach!! I want to have our ceremony around one of the preferred club pools, as most of my guests will be staying in the preferred section.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do you know where you want to have your ceremony or reception?!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1782765,"PostDate":1374705699,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Tiffany Ellison: I am a travel agent and the Bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I can talk to my boss tomorrow and find out some information for you. I am not sure if we do groups for all parts of the US, but I will ask and see. I know we've sent groups out of Detroit, Michigan.Do you know what day in May your going to have your wedding?!<\/p> <p> duchovny0901: We are having our ceremony on the beach!! I want to have our ceremony around one of the preferred club pools, as most of my guests will be staying in the preferred section.<\/p> <p> Do you know where you want to have your ceremony or reception?!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mary_mac0203@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368567681,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269591.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marbear0503","Id":269591,"Name":"Marbear0503","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14c2ab869a5bf7112815a9dd47942800","RawContent":"Marbear that&#039;s awesome! I&#039;m having my ceremony August 30, 2014 @ 4pm at the fountain! It looked so pretty from the videos and photos I&#039;ve seen. I&#039;m up in the air regarding the reception though; we haven&#039;t started booking rooms yet but as our guests are receiving the Save the Dates, they&#039;re getting very excited, and now we&#039;re anticipating closer to 70 guests instead of the 40 we thought we&#039;d have! Because of the large size of our group, I know some areas are already off the list. I&#039;m considering the ballroom but I haven&#039;t seen any good pictures of the space. I also thought about the nightclub; they have a nice terrace but I don&#039;t want my guests to be deathly hot while eating and dancing! Did you decide on any other details? Like photographer, DJ or excursions? I&#039;m so excited for you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1783133,"PostDate":1374761305,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Marbear that's awesome! I'm having my ceremony August 30, 2014 @ 4pm at the fountain! It looked so pretty from the videos and photos I've seen. I'm up in the air regarding the reception though; we haven't started booking rooms yet but as our guests are receiving the Save the Dates, they're getting very excited, and now we're anticipating closer to 70 guests instead of the 40 we thought we'd have! Because of the large size of our group, I know some areas are already off the list. I'm considering the ballroom but I haven't seen any good pictures of the space. I also thought about the nightclub; they have a nice terrace but I don't want my guests to be deathly hot while eating and dancing! Did you decide on any other details? Like photographer, DJ or excursions? I'm so excited for you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19a58689692bdeeafb0956c0a26a5308","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;chel&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p&gt; Hello all, I have been looking at Now larimar punta cana and dreams la romana, Im swaying slightly towards Now.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have been looking at their wedding guide and Im a little confused with their prices, so if anyone could shed some light on the Now wedding prices I would greatly appreciate it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My confusion has come from page 11 of the wedding guide &#039;additional wedding services&#039; I see all items listed through out the guide states $ however on page 11 it shows &amp;nbsp;a few items, such as the fire dancers as US$. Does that mean that all the other prices are actually RD$\/dominican pesos $?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Or are all prices USD$?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also on another note, can anyone shed some light on the outside vendor photography fee? I have a very close friend who is also a photographer. I have invited him to the wedding as a guest and also asked him to do the photography. Since he is also going to be a wedding guest he will be staying with us at the hotel so would the outside vendor fee apply to him to do the photography?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any info on these anyone has will be greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ;-)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; Hi Chel! These are all great questions actually! From what I understand the Additional Services list is in all US Dollars. My confirmation email stated that the exchange rate from Dominican pesos to USD is 41:1. So a violinist would cost about $10 USD for a 1 hour set. I&#039;m not sure if that right (haha) but I&#039;ll check with my wedding coordinator anyway! Photography: This has been a frequent question on all the NOW Larimar threads! The list of addtional services that I received when I made my wedding deposit stated \"Outside Photographer fee: US$ 500.00 per person \/day (do not includes food, beverage or any other service)\". I don&#039;t think you can get around this even if your friend is staying there unfortunately. I think this is extremely high though! My fiance and I are thinking we will stick with the resort photographer because they&#039;re included, but I must admit I&#039;m a bit nervous! I hope this helps!","Attachments":[],"Id":1783157,"PostDate":1374762694,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>chel<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p> Hello all, I have been looking at Now larimar punta cana and dreams la romana, Im swaying slightly towards Now.<\/p> <p> I have been looking at their wedding guide and Im a little confused with their prices, so if anyone could shed some light on the Now wedding prices I would greatly appreciate it.<\/p> <p> My confusion has come from page 11 of the wedding guide 'additional wedding services' I see all items listed through out the guide states $ however on page 11 it shows \u00a0a few items, such as the fire dancers as US$. Does that mean that all the other prices are actually RD$\/dominican pesos $?\u00a0<\/p> <p> Or are all prices USD$?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also on another note, can anyone shed some light on the outside vendor photography fee? I have a very close friend who is also a photographer. I have invited him to the wedding as a guest and also asked him to do the photography. Since he is also going to be a wedding guest he will be staying with us at the hotel so would the outside vendor fee apply to him to do the photography?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any info on these anyone has will be greatly appreciated.<\/p> <p> ;-)<\/p> <\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> Hi Chel! These are all great questions actually! From what I understand the Additional Services list is in all US Dollars. My confirmation email stated that the exchange rate from Dominican pesos to USD is 41:1. So a violinist would cost about $10 USD for a 1 hour set. I'm not sure if that right (haha) but I'll check with my wedding coordinator anyway! Photography: This has been a frequent question on all the NOW Larimar threads! The list of addtional services that I received when I made my wedding deposit stated \"Outside Photographer fee: US$ 500.00 per person \/day (do not includes food, beverage or any other service)\". I don't think you can get around this even if your friend is staying there unfortunately. I think this is extremely high though! My fiance and I are thinking we will stick with the resort photographer because they're included, but I must admit I'm a bit nervous! I hope this helps!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"271864d3d7153826084e27583df9bbf5","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]duchovny0901[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Chel! These are all great questions actually! From what I understand the Additional Services list is in all US Dollars. My confirmation email stated that the exchange rate from Dominican pesos to USD is 41:1. So a violinist would cost about $10 USD for a 1 hour set. I&#039;m not sure if that right (haha) but I&#039;ll check with my wedding coordinator anyway!Photography: This has been a frequent question on all the NOW Larimar threads! The list of addtional services that I received when I made my wedding deposit stated \"Outside Photographer fee: US$ 500.00 per person \/day (do not includes food, beverage or anyother service)\". I don&#039;t think you can get around this even if your friend is staying there unfortunately. I think this is extremely high though! My fiance and I are thinking we will stick with the resort photographer because they&#039;re included, but I must admit I&#039;m a bit nervous!I hope this helps![\/quote] \n Hi @duchovny0901, \n \n Congratulations for your upcoming wedding! \n You can see [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/g\/u\/63514\/WBA-Weddings\/photosets\/1\/\"]HERE[\/url] some samples of our photographers recent work... \n We hope to work with you for your special day. [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1783240,"PostDate":1374769049,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>duchovny0901<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> Hi Chel! These are all great questions actually! From what I understand the Additional Services list is in all US Dollars. My confirmation email stated that the exchange rate from Dominican pesos to USD is 41:1. So a violinist would cost about $10 USD for a 1 hour set. I'm not sure if that right (haha) but I'll check with my wedding coordinator anyway!Photography: This has been a frequent question on all the NOW Larimar threads! The list of addtional services that I received when I made my wedding deposit stated \"Outside Photographer fee: US$ 500.00 per person \/day (do not includes food, beverage or anyother service)\". I don't think you can get around this even if your friend is staying there unfortunately. I think this is extremely high though! My fiance and I are thinking we will stick with the resort photographer because they're included, but I must admit I'm a bit nervous!I hope this helps!<\/blockquote> <p> Hi @duchovny0901,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congratulations for your upcoming wedding!<\/p> <p> You can see <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/g\/u\/63514\/WBA-Weddings\/photosets\/1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>HERE<\/a> some samples of our photographers recent work...<\/p> <p> We hope to work with you for your special day.\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374786669101_1577\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"weddings@wbastudio.com","IpAddress":"186.6.222.235","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1350729395,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261572.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WBA Weddings","Id":261572,"Name":"WBA Weddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9b35b24ab037520e950f4490d9e71ae","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married June 7, 2014 at the jellyfish;) and our group is staying at now larimar...anyone else there the same week?","Attachments":[],"Id":1783259,"PostDate":1374771862,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married June 7, 2014 at the jellyfish;) and our group is staying at now larimar...anyone else there the same week?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bncandi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.40","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1355580172,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263262.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bncandi","Id":263262,"Name":"bncandi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eebf47805bbd8945e1aa6dd2491e244f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow Congradulation ! We had the confimation too for the 28th april 3:00PM !!! We will be getting married at the same place, the same day !!! We are from Quebec ! Let me know the developement of our organisation ! Good luck !&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We took divine package ? Do you take DJ or something for the night ?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you !&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Maxime&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1783457,"PostDate":1374824026,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow Congradulation ! We had the confimation too for the 28th april 3:00PM !!! We will be getting married at the same place, the same day !!! We are from Quebec ! Let me know the developement of our organisation ! Good luck !<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We took divine package ? Do you take DJ or something for the night ?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you !<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Maxime<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tacos_chihuahua@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.122.100.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1374823901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271923.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tacoschihuahua","Id":271923,"Name":"tacoschihuahua","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49842cac63ee8fb831cf93fcf9a5335c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow Congradulation ! We had the confimation too for the 28th april 3:00PM !!! We will be getting married at the same place, the same day !!! We are from Quebec ! Let me know the developement of our organisation ! Good luck !&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We took divine package ? Do you take DJ or something for the night ?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you !&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Maxime&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1783458,"PostDate":1374824026,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow Congradulation ! We had the confimation too for the 28th april 3:00PM !!! We will be getting married at the same place, the same day !!! We are from Quebec ! Let me know the developement of our organisation ! Good luck !<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We took divine package ? Do you take DJ or something for the night ?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you !<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Maxime<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tacos_chihuahua@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.122.100.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1374823901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271923.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tacoschihuahua","Id":271923,"Name":"tacoschihuahua","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1690b1980bc87160695b39877175a602","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am wanting to book with Now for my wedding next July, does anyone have a more extensive list of add-ons and prices? I want to have the best idea possible for what it is going to cost before I make my decision. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1784060,"PostDate":1374948123,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am wanting to book with Now for my wedding next July, does anyone have a more extensive list of add-ons and prices? I want to have the best idea possible for what it is going to cost before I make my decision. Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gabbabb14@gmail.com","IpAddress":"8.28.240.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1374759807,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271904.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dcheer14","Id":271904,"Name":"dcheer14","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":100,"NextPage":110,"PreviousPage":90,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
