{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6710215b3c2486cd2ae2b33bace7a351","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dcheer14\"]\nI am wanting to book with Now for my wedding next July, does anyone have a more extensive list of add-ons and prices? I want to have the best idea possible for what it is going to cost before I make my decision. Thanks![\/quote] dcheer I recently confirmed my wedding date there and have some 2014 price listings saved on my comp. I don&#039;t know how to post here so private message me your email addy and I can send them to u!","Attachments":[],"Id":1784284,"PostDate":1375027995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"dcheer14\" url=\"\/t\/85114\/now&#045;larimar&#045;2014&#045;brides\/90#post_1932129\"><p>I am wanting to book with Now for my wedding next July, does anyone have a more extensive list of add-ons and prices? I want to have the best idea possible for what it is going to cost before I make my decision. Thanks!<\/p><\/blockquote> dcheer I recently confirmed my wedding date there and have some 2014 price listings saved on my comp. I don't know how to post here so private message me your email addy and I can send them to u!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"292ff8ecc23a614a342e773285718478","RawContent":"I&#039;m new to the thread. Just got my confirmation for July 12, 2014. I&#039;m having a really hard time deciding on the reception location and whether I should pay the extra money to do it private. We are expecting around 40-50 people and are trying to limit our budget. Im also a little confused as to what is included for decorations. Any suggestions or experience would be greatly appreciated.","Attachments":[],"Id":1784372,"PostDate":1375042387,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm new to the thread. Just got my confirmation for July 12, 2014. I'm having a really hard time deciding on the reception location and whether I should pay the extra money to do it private. We are expecting around 40-50 people and are trying to limit our budget. Im also a little confused as to what is included for decorations. Any suggestions or experience would be greatly appreciated.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joneill85@gmail.com","IpAddress":"166.137.12.127","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375040897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271994.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"foreverlove","Id":271994,"Name":"foreverlove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f565b4fc128de970415743825128c981","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Tacoschihuahua, that is amazing we are getting married at the same place on the same day!! We are doing the divine package as well!! No we are not going to get a DJ, we are just going to bring an ipod dock!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1784416,"PostDate":1375047693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Tacoschihuahua, that is amazing we are getting married at the same place on the same day!! We are doing the divine package as well!! No we are not going to get a DJ, we are just going to bring an ipod dock!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mary_mac0203@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368567681,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269591.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marbear0503","Id":269591,"Name":"Marbear0503","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62503c5d13e6c12370e8b44d9a9db0fa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Does anyone know if its necessary to pay for a bar during the reception or are there bars nearby that the guests could get drinks at?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1784432,"PostDate":1375050018,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Does anyone know if its necessary to pay for a bar during the reception or are there bars nearby that the guests could get drinks at?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gabbabb14@gmail.com","IpAddress":"8.28.240.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1374759807,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271904.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dcheer14","Id":271904,"Name":"dcheer14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81a02319e025e9f30297b26f77208231","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I would like to see the photo&#039;s for all of the options for restaurants for the reception. Have you seen them anywhere?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1784609,"PostDate":1375100042,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I would like to see the photo's for all of the options for restaurants for the reception. Have you seen them anywhere?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danielle404@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375099525,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272013.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"danielle404","Id":272013,"Name":"danielle404","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68d5c6d39179d9e13d6df9680afb1127","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I thought that if you have the \"your moment\" package and that you paid for a reception with dinner, that the bar was included for the three hours! I could be wrong though, but I hope I will not have to pay a fee per guests per hour!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1784837,"PostDate":1375125718,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I thought that if you have the \"your moment\" package and that you paid for a reception with dinner, that the bar was included for the three hours! I could be wrong though, but I hope I will not have to pay a fee per guests per hour!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mjouellette0@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.118.194.63","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1361218226,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266253.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJ Ouellette","Id":266253,"Name":"MJ Ouellette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d72a0a36aaea18f74b5fcffda59eb6c6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was in contact with Pastor York back in May, but now I am sending him messages and it says that my emails cannot be delivered... Am I the only one who cannot reach him anymore???&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am starting to be worried... might need to find another Pastor???&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And, what are you doing for music? are you taking the Resort`s DJ, outside vendor or just renting speakers for your ipod?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1784839,"PostDate":1375125904,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> I was in contact with Pastor York back in May, but now I am sending him messages and it says that my emails cannot be delivered... Am I the only one who cannot reach him anymore???<\/p> <p> I am starting to be worried... might need to find another Pastor???<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And, what are you doing for music? are you taking the Resort`s DJ, outside vendor or just renting speakers for your ipod?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mjouellette0@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.118.194.63","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1361218226,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266253.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJ Ouellette","Id":266253,"Name":"MJ Ouellette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"672bd83324dffaf5d8484308a5455a7a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; MJ Ouellette, we are just going to bring our own Ipod dock. The one we have is really good and goes loud. I am trying to cut down on extra costs as much as possible :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And we are having a symbolic ceremony, so I don&#039;t know anything about the pastor stuff. We couldn&#039;t be bothered with all the extra costs for that and to translate everything.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, I don&#039;t think any package comes with bar but I could be wrong. I&#039;ll have to ask my wedding coordinator.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1784915,"PostDate":1375134477,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> MJ Ouellette, we are just going to bring our own Ipod dock. The one we have is really good and goes loud. I am trying to cut down on extra costs as much as possible <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> And we are having a symbolic ceremony, so I don't know anything about the pastor stuff. We couldn't be bothered with all the extra costs for that and to translate everything.<\/p> <p> Also, I don't think any package comes with bar but I could be wrong. I'll have to ask my wedding coordinator.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mary_mac0203@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368567681,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269591.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marbear0503","Id":269591,"Name":"Marbear0503","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf583345053332430a50d7addebfdca5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have the devine package and I get a free bar for the reception for 3 hours&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1784977,"PostDate":1375153635,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have the devine package and I get a free bar for the reception for 3 hours<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amyevans_5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"84.93.51.41","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367308245,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269144.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AMYEVANS","Id":269144,"Name":"AMYEVANS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9fd96027418ce03e179d54ed3a671e5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have the \"your moment\" package because it was cheaper to pay everything separate than to take one of the bigger packages. I asked my wedding coordinator about the bar and here is her reply:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is the bar included in the 3 hour reception?&lt;span style=\"line-height: 22px; color: rgb(31, 73, 125); \"&gt;&amp;nbsp;Yes! As you request your moments wedding package the reception is not included. You can add a dinner package that included a private bar for three hours up to 25 guest.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So, I have around 45 guests and I am taking the Gold buffet, therefore I pay 750$+tax and 45$+tax for additional guests. What I understand from her email is that the 750$ includes t&lt;u&gt;he dinner and bar &lt;\/u&gt;for 25 people. Now I am wondering if the 45$ for additional guests includes the dinner +bar or just dinner. If not, then I would pay 45$(dinner) + 18$( premium bar) for each of my additional guests!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; It can get really confusing, and I would like to avoid as many \"surprise costs\" as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Same thing for the chair. it&#039;s 3$ for extra chairs... do you have to pay that fee twice if you have a ceremony and a reception!? Their guide is helpful but lacks details...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1785168,"PostDate":1375185822,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have the \"your moment\" package because it was cheaper to pay everything separate than to take one of the bigger packages. I asked my wedding coordinator about the bar and here is her reply:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u><strong>Is the bar included in the 3 hour reception?<span  style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125)\">\u00a0Yes! As you request your moments wedding package the reception is not included. You can add a dinner package that included a private bar for three hours up to 25 guest.<\/span><\/strong><\/u><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So, I have around 45 guests and I am taking the Gold buffet, therefore I pay 750$+tax and 45$+tax for additional guests. What I understand from her email is that the 750$ includes t<u>he dinner and bar <\/u>for 25 people. Now I am wondering if the 45$ for additional guests includes the dinner +bar or just dinner. If not, then I would pay 45$(dinner) + 18$( premium bar) for each of my additional guests!\u00a0<\/p> <p> It can get really confusing, and I would like to avoid as many \"surprise costs\" as possible!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Same thing for the chair. it's 3$ for extra chairs... do you have to pay that fee twice if you have a ceremony and a reception!? Their guide is helpful but lacks details...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mjouellette0@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.118.194.63","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1361218226,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266253.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJ Ouellette","Id":266253,"Name":"MJ Ouellette","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":110,"NextPage":120,"PreviousPage":100,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
