{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"25b226ecf4330fae0dee8afeb93dc5f7","RawContent":"We haven&#039;t been assigned a coordinator yet. Who&#039;s your coordinator?","Attachments":[],"Id":1786742,"PostDate":1375478230,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We haven't been assigned a coordinator yet. Who's your coordinator?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberk90@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372752045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271117.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberk90","Id":271117,"Name":"amberk90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ebf424b83fd4621e1d031eec135eeeb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We&#039;ve been assigned Luisa Miranda. I&#039;ve heard nothing but great things about her from the Now Larimar forums so I&#039;m excited. I preparing a list of questions to ask her but it&#039;s so lengthy that I think maybe I need to cut it up so she won&#039;t think I&#039;m overzealous!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1786830,"PostDate":1375522037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We've been assigned Luisa Miranda. I've heard nothing but great things about her from the Now Larimar forums so I'm excited. I preparing a list of questions to ask her but it's so lengthy that I think maybe I need to cut it up so she won't think I'm overzealous!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1585705401527ff6d34b00d2fbe08863","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies!!! &amp;nbsp;I just booked my June 6th wedding at NOW!! &amp;nbsp;We are doing the 6pm time slot... but I am not sure where we will do the ceremony yet (not on the beach.) &amp;nbsp;What are you guys finding for pricing for dinner\/drinks? &amp;nbsp;I am guessing I will be having about 60 guests. &amp;nbsp;It is just so confusing since it is \"All Inclusive\" but you pay for the reception dinner and drinks. &amp;nbsp;Also, are any of you using outside vendors? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1786873,"PostDate":1375533755,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies!!! \u00a0I just booked my June 6th wedding at NOW!! \u00a0We are doing the 6pm time slot... but I am not sure where we will do the ceremony yet (not on the beach.) \u00a0What are you guys finding for pricing for dinner\/drinks? \u00a0I am guessing I will be having about 60 guests. \u00a0It is just so confusing since it is \"All Inclusive\" but you pay for the reception dinner and drinks. \u00a0Also, are any of you using outside vendors? \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bethlorentz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.88.29.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375533315,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272212.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bethlorentz","Id":272212,"Name":"bethlorentz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e0e6433ac3d255ee9b5421713f6178b","RawContent":"We have also just been assigned Luisa Miranda. I&#039;m so happy to hear you&#039;ve heard nothing but good things. I have not read any forums about her so hopefully I will come across them as well!","Attachments":[],"Id":1786942,"PostDate":1375545857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We have also just been assigned Luisa Miranda. I'm so happy to hear you've heard nothing but good things. I have not read any forums about her so hopefully I will come across them as well!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberk90@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372752045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271117.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberk90","Id":271117,"Name":"amberk90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2fbb65ca6bdd8dae5742e493d5d3be1","RawContent":"I have luisa and i already she is awesome :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1786943,"PostDate":1375546708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n   