{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2c64709780a6b21905946b25843a0b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; @Kristina Simms - I am curious to know what is the bridal suite? Do you get your hair and makeup done in the bridal suite or do you still have to go to the spa,??? how much does it cost to rent the bridal suite? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1793996,"PostDate":1377242532,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> @Kristina Simms - I am curious to know what is the bridal suite? Do you get your hair and makeup done in the bridal suite or do you still have to go to the spa,??? how much does it cost to rent the bridal suite? \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mjouellette0@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.118.194.63","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1361218226,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266253.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJ Ouellette","Id":266253,"Name":"MJ Ouellette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb7c9e4c39019ee571d79f985d830939","RawContent":"@bethlorentz I never even really thought about that!! Great idea! I already ordered from a different site tho, but thank-you. @MJ Ouellette the bridal suite costs $150 for a half day. My booking is from 10-3. Your hair and makeup all get done there. It&#039;s a good place for the ladies to hang out and get ready. I&#039;m pretty sure you get champagne and fruit too!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1794437,"PostDate":1377366461,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @bethlorentz I never even really thought about that!! Great idea! I already ordered from a different site tho, but thank-you. @MJ Ouellette the bridal suite costs $150 for a half day. My booking is from 10-3. Your hair and makeup all get done there. It's a good place for the ladies to hang out and get ready. I'm pretty sure you get champagne and fruit too!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357849978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdd5c91f90294f185f1b43f49b2e1bb0","RawContent":"Hello ladies!!! I have officially heard back from the resort and my date has been confirmed for October 18 2014 at 5:30 on the beach!!! I&#039;m getting excited already!!!! My wedding coordinator is Ms. Yeomandry Collado. Has anyone worked with her yet??","Attachments":[],"Id":1796468,"PostDate":1377939450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies!!! I have officially heard back from the resort and my date has been confirmed for October 18 2014 at 5:30 on the beach!!! I'm getting excited already!!!! My wedding coordinator is Ms. Yeomandry Collado. Has anyone worked with her yet??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsconner1983@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.173.180.132","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362996207,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267190.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jahanee Conner","Id":267190,"Name":"Jahanee Conner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bee4dcaabe67454b2b22199313defd35","RawContent":"I will be staying at NOW and meeting w\/ Mercy to conduct a site visit next week. I would be more than happy to ask her any questions you may have! We will be departing 9\/7\/13 post all question prior to then!! -happy planning!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1796928,"PostDate":1378138001,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I will be staying at NOW and meeting w\/ Mercy to conduct a site visit next week. I would be more than happy to ask her any questions you may have! We will be departing 9\/7\/13 post all question prior to then!! -happy planning!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375995069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7960fe8fa578768e21b38c74148500ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!! I hope planning is going well! I just wanted to share with you guys my save the dates. Since we are traveling what better way to represent the idea of traveling with luggage tag save the dates. I was inspired by another bride on BDW PynkLemonade.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"219557\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/219557\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"219556\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/219556\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1798372,"PostDate":1378626590,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!! I hope planning is going well! I just wanted to share with you guys my save the dates. Since we are traveling what better way to represent the idea of traveling with luggage tag save the dates. I was inspired by another bride on BDW PynkLemonade.<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"219557\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/219557\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"219556\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/219556\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vgarcia0788@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368986102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269745.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bride473473","Id":269745,"Name":"bride473473","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2dcc0c4791be1e9de47116e9e96c7fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am April 2014 as well at Now Larimar :) Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1798490,"PostDate":1378661129,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am April 2014 as well at Now Larimar <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice_weir03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1378660956,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273307.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CandyMarie","Id":273307,"Name":"CandyMarie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId"