{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b937467c1d6007f9308b33ba1771dd74","RawContent":"&lt;h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51, 51, 51)\"&gt;Hey there. Can anyone tell me if this is an average sized resort compared to others in the area? Google Maps shows it could span as long as .5 miles back in length, which would make it bigger than Melia, but half the amount of rooms. Can anyone shed some light on the size? &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/h5&gt; &lt;h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/h5&gt; &lt;h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51, 51, 51)\"&gt;I&#039;ve reserved&amp;nbsp;a May 22, 2014 -6pm-&amp;nbsp;beach wedding followed by a beach reception. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m still on the fence though as it has been weeks since my travel agent has heard from the resort. &amp;nbsp;So any info would be GREATLY appreciated!&amp;nbsp;Thanks so much!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/h5&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1802380,"PostDate":1380007810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Hey there. Can anyone tell me if this is an average sized resort compared to others in the area? Google Maps shows it could span as long as .5 miles back in length, which would make it bigger than Melia, but half the amount of rooms. Can anyone shed some light on the size? <\/span><\/h5> <h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\">\u00a0<\/h5> <h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(51, 51, 51)\">I've reserved\u00a0a May 22, 2014 -6pm-\u00a0beach wedding followed by a beach reception. \u00a0I'm still on the fence though as it has been weeks since my travel agent has heard from the resort. \u00a0So any info would be GREATLY appreciated!\u00a0Thanks so much!<\/span><\/h5>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisamarco413@aol.com","IpAddress":"174.107.97.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379959023,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273703.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lisamarco413","Id":273703,"Name":"lisamarco413","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f87f0550a72c8fafaf49dd8237bb174","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lisamarco413&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51, 51, 51)\"&gt;Hey there. Can anyone tell me if this is an average sized resort compared to others in the area? Google Maps shows it could span as long as .5 miles back in length, which would make it bigger than Melia, but half the amount of rooms. Can anyone shed some light on the size? &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/h5&gt; &lt;h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/h5&gt; &lt;h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51, 51, 51)\"&gt;I&#039;ve reserved&amp;nbsp;a May 22, 2014 -6pm-&amp;nbsp;beach wedding followed by a beach reception. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m still on the fence though as it has been weeks since my travel agent has heard from the resort. &amp;nbsp;So any info would be GREATLY appreciated!&amp;nbsp;Thanks so much!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/h5&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;it is way smaller than melia and overall it is considered one of the smaller ones in the area. Maybe it looks big in google maps because the sister resort secrets royal beach which is adults only is right next to it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1802387,"PostDate":1380008628,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>lisamarco413<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Hey there. Can anyone tell me if this is an average sized resort compared to others in the area? Google Maps shows it could span as long as .5 miles back in length, which would make it bigger than Melia, but half the amount of rooms. Can anyone shed some light on the size? <\/span><\/h5> <h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\">\u00a0<\/h5> <h5 style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom:5px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:15px; padding-right:20px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(51, 51, 51)\">I've reserved\u00a0a May 22, 2014 -6pm-\u00a0beach wedding followed by a beach reception. \u00a0I'm still on the fence though as it has been weeks since my travel agent has heard from the resort. \u00a0So any info would be GREATLY appreciated!\u00a0Thanks so much!<\/span><\/h5> <\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>it is way smaller than melia and overall it is considered one of the smaller ones in the area. Maybe it looks big in google maps because the sister resort secrets royal beach which is adults only is right next to it.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"knc2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"156.145.107.119","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370858079,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270422.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KnC2014","Id":270422,"Name":"KnC2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83cc519f734a1be6da92113d417020f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you! &amp;nbsp;We became confused by the Now Larimar&#039;s interactive map (&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"221678\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221678\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;So if it&#039;s just the area in red, then it&#039;s the same size as Secrets? &amp;nbsp;We have some non-mobile adults and young children, a .5 mile walk would not be ok for them. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m just so nervous to book without seeing the place! Did you feel that way?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1802388,"PostDate":1380008824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you! \u00a0We became confused by the Now Larimar's interactive map (<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"221678\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221678\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>So if it's just the area in red, then it's the same size as Secrets? \u00a0We have some non-mobile adults and young children, a .5 mile walk would not be ok for them. \u00a0I'm just so nervous to book without seeing the place! Did you feel that way?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisamarco413@aol.com","IpAddress":"174.107.97.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379959023,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273703.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lisamarco413","Id":273703,"Name":"lisamarco413","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c67717476e27b79274cd61fc5d43ce4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey there. &amp;nbsp;This is the fourth time I&#039;ve seen thins $5k to reserve a restaurant. &amp;nbsp; I didnt see this in any material from the resort nor hear about it from my travel agent. &amp;nbsp;Could you please explain in more detail what this is for? &amp;nbsp;I put a deposit down for May 22, 2014, beach ceremony and beach restaurant reception. &amp;nbsp;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1802394,"PostDate":1380011116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey there. \u00a0This is the fourth time I've seen thins $5k to reserve a restaurant. \u00a0 I didnt see this in any material from the resort nor hear about it from my travel agent. \u00a0Could you please explain in more detail what this is for? \u00a0I put a deposit down for May 22, 2014, beach ceremony and beach restaurant reception. \u00a0Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisamarco413@aol.com","IpAddress":"174.107.97.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379959023,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273703.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lisamarco413","Id":273703,"Name":"lisamarco413","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1697ff727db71d367e7a06355dbbc5ed","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lisamarco413&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there. &amp;nbsp;This is the fourth time I&#039;ve seen thins $5k to reserve a restaurant. &amp;nbsp; I didnt see this in any material from the resort nor hear about it from my travel agent. &amp;nbsp;Could you please explain in more detail what this is for? &amp;nbsp;I put a deposit down for May 22, 2014, beach ceremony and beach restaurant reception. &amp;nbsp;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; Hi lisamarco! The $5k is to reserve an entire restaurant for a private reception dinner. The restaurants include Mercure, Castaways, and Capers. This is found on Page 13 of the wedding guide. Since you have a beach reception though, you won&#039;t have to pay the $5k fee. I hope this helps!","Attachments":[],"Id":1802401,"PostDate":1380012803,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>lisamarco413<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p>Hey there. \u00a0This is the fourth time I've seen thins $5k to reserve a restaurant. \u00a0 I didnt see this in any material from the resort nor hear about it from my travel agent. \u00a0Could you please explain in more detail what this is for? \u00a0I put a deposit down for May 22, 2014, beach ceremony and beach restaurant reception. \u00a0Thanks!<\/p> <\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> Hi lisamarco! The $5k is to reserve an entire restaurant for a private reception dinner. The restaurants include Mercure, Castaways, and Capers. This is found on Page 13 of the wedding guide. Since you have a beach reception though, you won't have to pay the $5k fee. I hope this helps!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c3950e987b184383a1781116af4a0dc","RawContent":"Oh I just looked at my spreadsheet again that was sent from the WC. Specifically the $5k extra fee is for reserving the Mercure or Tamarindo restaurants. Castaways is only $3K.","Attachments":[],"Id":1802938,"PostDate":1380193806,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh I just looked at my spreadsheet again that was sent from the WC. Specifically the $5k extra fee is for reserving the Mercure or Tamarindo restaurants. Castaways is only $3K.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9eb39a5d6d2704fff75dd2ab41a70305","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;duchovny0901&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n Oh I just looked at my spreadsheet again that was sent from the WC. Specifically the $5k extra fee is for reserving the Mercure or Tamarindo restaurants. Castaways is only $3K.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Is Castaways the name of the Beach Restaurant? &amp;nbsp;My travel agent was under the impression that there wouldn&#039;t be a fee for the &#039;beach restaurant&#039; but is becoming more clueless in the process!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1802943,"PostDate":1380194855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>duchovny0901<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Oh I just looked at my spreadsheet again that was sent from the WC. Specifically the $5k extra fee is for reserving the Mercure or Tamarindo restaurants. Castaways is only $3K.<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Is Castaways the name of the Beach Restaurant? \u00a0My travel agent was under the impression that there wouldn't be a fee for the 'beach restaurant' but is becoming more clueless in the process!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisamarco413@aol.com","IpAddress":"174.107.97.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379959023,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273703.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lisamarco413","Id":273703,"Name":"lisamarco413","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd75d3957fb5f0d6890480d9b679e2f0","RawContent":"I looked at the resort map and Castaways seems to be the closest restaurant to the beach. But the wedding guide says you can have your reception on the actual beach for free....I know it is seems so confusing! I&#039;d double check your Wedding Coordinator to confirm.","Attachments":[],"Id":1802945,"PostDate":1380195498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I looked at the resort map and Castaways seems to be the closest restaurant to the beach. But the wedding guide says you can have your reception on the actual beach for free....I know it is seems so confusing! I'd double check your Wedding Coordinator to confirm.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bde6a6c30e295eb9852a29b6d6c9c0a","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;Hello lovely brides, its been a while since last time, a lot of thing has happened &amp;nbsp;in the meantime resulting in the evolution of my brand and my art.\n &amp;nbsp;Asia Pimentel begins a new stage and I feel so proud to introduce my brand new website &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"*\" data-id=\"222079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222079\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:350px\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;A warm greeting from Dominican Republic!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;Asia Pimentel&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1803401,"PostDate":1380371848,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">Hello lovely brides, its been a while since last time, a lot of thing has happened \u00a0in the meantime resulting in the evolution of my brand and my art.<br \/> \u00a0Asia Pimentel begins a new stage and I feel so proud to introduce my brand new website \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*\" data-id=\"222079\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222079\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:350px\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">A warm greeting from Dominican Republic!<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">Asia Pimentel<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pimentelasiak@gmail.com","IpAddress":"186.6.63.216","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1349909510,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261240.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Asia Pimentel","Id":261240,"Name":"Asia Pimentel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aabb7bcefd9a704be945253c0a72aee1","RawContent":"The restaurants are very good... The French one is amazing!!!! And it&#039;s beautiful!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1803423,"PostDate":1380376851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The restaurants are very good... The French one is amazing!!!! And it's beautiful!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay.vaillancourt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378727169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273327.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay2015","Id":273327,"Name":"kay2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":180,"NextPage":190,"PreviousPage":170,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
