> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ebb8b36b5f86e80efe42d1675cee998","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=\"huddler-mention\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"\/u\/75795\/lisamarco413\"&gt;lisamarco413&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I got personalized silk fans online from beau-coup (they ship to Canada). I originally found some from The Knot.com but they don&#039;t ship outside of the US. I also got 20 oz Bubba Keg mugs from www.shopbubba.com. We were planning on getting the mugs engraved with our names and wedding date but once we received them and brought them to the engraving store the quote was $500+ for 25 mugs. So if you are looking to get them engraved I would recommend doing so from where you order.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We ended up buying some personalized \"recovery kit\" bags from Etsy and filling those with goodies that we will attach to the mugs.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=\"huddler-mention\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"\/u\/71202\/meganjune\"&gt;meganjune&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Your pictures are stunning, you looked amazing! Thanks for sharing :)&amp;nbsp;I have the same groomsmen gifts as you, gotta love Etsy! Great idea to add a little bottle of whisky in there! Your shoes were beautiful, where did you get them?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Kristina&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1818137,"PostDate":1386092401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span class=\"huddler-mention\">@<\/span><a href='\/u\/75795\/lisamarco413' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>lisamarco413<\/a><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I got personalized silk fans online from beau-coup (they ship to Canada). I originally found some from The Knot.com but they don't ship outside of the US. I also got 20 oz Bubba Keg mugs from www.shopbubba.com. We were planning on getting the mugs engraved with our names and wedding date but once we received them and brought them to the engraving store the quote was $500+ for 25 mugs. So if you are looking to get them engraved I would recommend doing so from where you order.\u00a0<\/p> <p>We ended up buying some personalized \"recovery kit\" bags from Etsy and filling those with goodies that we will attach to the mugs.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span class=\"huddler-mention\">@<\/span><a href='\/u\/71202\/meganjune' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>meganjune<\/a><\/p> <p>Your pictures are stunning, you looked amazing! Thanks for sharing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0I have the same groomsmen gifts as you, gotta love Etsy! Great idea to add a little bottle of whisky in there! Your shoes were beautiful, where did you get them?<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Kristina<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357849978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66dd6f6887f997516b114c2f0a503bf9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@meganjune Thanks for sharing your photos! They are gorgeous and so are you! Just wondering, where did you purchase your bridesmaids foot jewelry? And did you make your own centerpieces?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1818403,"PostDate":1386335883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@meganjune Thanks for sharing your photos! They are gorgeous and so are you! Just wondering, where did you purchase your bridesmaids foot jewelry? And did you make your own centerpieces?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.107.97.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1388775087,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32f93b6a4953868981e842bf634e0a63","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\"&gt;@&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/72769\/duchovny0901\" title=\"\"&gt;duchovny0901&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\"&gt;, @&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/69282\/jahanee-conner\" title=\"\"&gt;Jahanee Conner&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\"&gt;, @&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/66280\/kristina-simms\" title=\"\"&gt;Kristina Simms&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\"&gt;, @&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/60190\/EVKnowsitall\" title=\"\"&gt;EVKnowsitall&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\"&gt;, @&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/71683\/marbear0503\" title=\"\"&gt;Marbear0503&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\"&gt;, @&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(70,70,70);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(70,70,70);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/71917\/jldinapoli\" title=\"\"&gt;jldinapoli&lt;\/a&gt;, @ meganjune, @ dr2015&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Hey all!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOUR &lt;\/strong&gt;months away and now the stress and anxiety are starting to set in! &amp;nbsp;Some more random questions!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;1. What size sashes do they use? &amp;nbsp;Is anyone bringing their own? &amp;nbsp;Can they move then from the ceremony chairs to the reception chairs? &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;Is it doubled, ceremony and reception?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;\"&gt;2. On the spreadsheet for the DIVINE Package, anyone know what the following items are:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;\"Lounge Area 6 pax\u201d&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; \"Lighted bar\"&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; \"LED light\"&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;3. Suggestions for cheap alternatives for pomanders?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;4. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\"&gt;T&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;\"&gt;he Do Not Disturb Honeymoon Package. &amp;nbsp;Anyone have this or know what it is\/includes?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;\"&gt;5. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;\"&gt;Does anyone know if guests can have their suits and dresses steamed\/ironed at the resort? I&#039;m sure there would be a fee for it but a few of the ladies coming keep asking and I don&#039;t have an answer!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;\"&gt;6. &amp;nbsp;Did anyone do fireworks at their receptions? &amp;nbsp;I havent seen any pictures of it and would love to know how it turned out!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;\"&gt;Thanks everyone! &amp;nbsp;You have been my lifesavers!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1822207,"PostDate":1388774904,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">@\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/72769\/duchovny0901' class='bbc_url' title=''>duchovny0901<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">, @\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/69282\/jahanee-conner' class='bbc_url' title=''>Jahanee Conner<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">, @\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/66280\/kristina-simms' class='bbc_url' title=''>Kristina Simms<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">, @\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/60190\/EVKnowsitall' class='bbc_url' title=''>EVKnowsitall<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">, @\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/71683\/marbear0503' class='bbc_url' title=''>Marbear0503<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">, @<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(70,70,70)\">\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(70,70,70)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/71917\/jldinapoli' class='bbc_url' title=''>jldinapoli<\/a>, @ meganjune, @ dr2015<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>Hey all!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>FOUR <\/strong>months away and now the stress and anxiety are starting to set in! \u00a0Some more random questions!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">1. What size sashes do they use? \u00a0Is anyone bringing their own? \u00a0Can they move then from the ceremony chairs to the reception chairs? <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px\">\u00a0Is it doubled, ceremony and reception?<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px\">2. On the spreadsheet for the DIVINE Package, anyone know what the following items are:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\"Lounge Area 6 pax\u201d<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \"Lighted bar\"<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \"LED light\"<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">3. Suggestions for cheap alternatives for pomanders?<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">4. <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">T<\/span><span  style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px\">he Do Not Disturb Honeymoon Package. \u00a0Anyone have this or know what it is\/includes?<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px\">5. <\/span><span  style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px\">Does anyone know if guests can have their suits and dresses steamed\/ironed at the resort? I'm sure there would be a fee for it but a few of the ladies coming keep asking and I don't have an answer!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:15px\">6. \u00a0Did anyone do fireworks at their receptions? \u00a0I havent seen any pictures of it and would love to know how it turned out!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:15px\">Thanks everyone! \u00a0You have been my lifesavers!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisamarco413@aol.com","IpAddress":"174.107.97.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379959023,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273703.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lisamarco413","Id":273703,"Name":"lisamarco413","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8eb4c1cfbe509c8ec4749c5efad781ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey @[member=\"lisamarco413\"]! Your wedding is so close! I know with the nerves you&#039;re super excited, and I&#039;m excited for you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Well I do know about the sashes; you have to get two sets, one for the ceremony and one for the reception, as I&#039;ve already asked my WC about this to cut costs. I am planning to bring my own due to the amount of ppl I&#039;m expecting (up to about 75 now) and I&#039;ve been getting samples from&amp;nbsp;wholesalers on eBay to see if they&amp;nbsp;will match my&amp;nbsp;wedding colors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, I think that if the bride and groom can get their garments steamed the guests should be able to as well. Or at least I hope so!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1822540,"PostDate":1388857513,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273703\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/273703-lisamarco413\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lisamarco413<\/span><\/a>! Your wedding is so close! I know with the nerves you're super excited, and I'm excited for you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Well I do know about the sashes; you have to get two sets, one for the ceremony and one for the reception, as I've already asked my WC about this to cut costs. I am planning to bring my own due to the amount of ppl I'm expecting (up to about 75 now) and I've been getting samples from\u00a0wholesalers on eBay to see if they\u00a0will match my\u00a0wedding colors.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, I think that if the bride and groom can get their garments steamed the guests should be able to as well. Or at least I hope so!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.159.22.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d21ce8afcb6fd17e6af8c0ab647159f","RawContent":"Hello:)  I am getting married at Now Larimar November 2014.  My fiance and I have gone with the Divine package with our ceremony at the fountain, and our recption being poolside.  I picked my colours for the chair sashes, etc as turquoise.  Also, does anyone have any suggestions on getting married at now Larimar and also the DJ package and photographer packages  Thank you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1823153,"PostDate":1388987366,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello:)  I am getting married at Now Larimar November 2014.  My fiance and I have gone with the Divine package with our ceremony at the fountain, and our recption being poolside.  I picked my colours for the chair sashes, etc as turquoise.  Also, does anyone have any suggestions on getting married at now Larimar and also the DJ package and photographer packages  Thank you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adrieanneb@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.159.22.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375733038,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272285.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Adrieanne","Id":272285,"Name":"Adrieanne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.244.31.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5319afae53601c2383c5f1bc37eeb321","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Brides! Ive been skimming this site for some months now! I am getting married at the Now Larimar on August 29, 2014. I am expecting about 40 guests. Im so excited!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1824738,"PostDate":1389356932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Brides! Ive been skimming this site for some months now! I am getting married at the Now Larimar on August 29, 2014. I am expecting about 40 guests. Im so excited!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sohoward82@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.244.31.111","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372588544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271063.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsFountain2B","Id":271063,"Name":"MrsFountain2B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"becdd083805cd43c8a702c3cdb059203","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Well my wedding is 18 days away, and yes I am starting to freak out a little. My biggest concern is I cannot get a hold of my photographer that I booked back in August.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone else booked with Karina Jensen photography??? I&#039;ve sent numerous emails and a message through FB. Help! I&#039;m really starting to get worried.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1824838,"PostDate":1389377164,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Well my wedding is 18 days away, and yes I am starting to freak out a little. My biggest concern is I cannot get a hold of my photographer that I booked back in August.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone else booked with Karina Jensen photography??? I've sent numerous emails and a message through FB. Help! I'm really starting to get worried.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357849978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.59.10.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e42782bc1af8450d7e0c42de43f801e6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Kristina Simms\" post=\"1824838\" timestamp=\"1389395164\"]\nHello ladies!\n\nWell my wedding is 18 days away, and yes I am starting to freak out a little. My biggest concern is I cannot get a hold of my photographer that I booked back in August. \nHas anyone else booked with Karina Jensen photography??? I&#039;ve sent numerous emails and a message through FB. Help! I&#039;m really starting to get worried. \n\nThanks!![\/quote]Hey, \n\nWe booked with Karina but are wedding isn&#039;t for another 5 weeks.  We just e-mailed her about our Trash the Dress Shoot, I&#039;ll let you know if I hear back from her.","Attachments":[],"Id":1824842,"PostDate":1389377998,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kristina Simms, on 10 January 2014 - 06:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Well my wedding is 18 days away, and yes I am starting to freak out a little. My biggest concern is I cannot get a hold of my photographer that I booked back in August.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone else booked with Karina Jensen photography??? I've sent numerous emails and a message through FB. Help! I'm really starting to get worried.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We booked with Karina but are wedding isn't for another 5 weeks. \u00a0We just e-mailed her about our Trash the Dress Shoot, I'll let you know if I hear back from her.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlstockslager@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.59.10.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369168942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269825.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jldinapoli","Id":269825,"Name":"jldinapoli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af6c88d651c310bdab3b032d22c18a50","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jldinapoli\"] &amp;nbsp;Thanks so much! I feel like i&#039;m stalking her sending messages to every account I can! lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1824847,"PostDate":1389378414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"269825\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/269825-jldinapoli\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jldinapoli<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Thanks so much! I feel like i'm stalking her sending messages to every account I can! lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357849978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.60.151.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3265e79820a396482822ed3741294af7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Kristina Simms\"] how exciting! Ive read several reviews about that photographer. Im sure you will be fine! Please let us know how everything goes! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1825140,"PostDate":1389465929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"264243\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/264243-kristina-simms\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kristina Simms<\/span><\/a> how exciting! Ive read several reviews about that photographer. Im sure you will be fine! Please let us know how everything goes! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sohoward82@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.244.31.111","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372588544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271063.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsFountain2B","Id":271063,"Name":"MrsFountain2B","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":230,"NextPage":240,"PreviousPage":220,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
