> Time: 1457735246 / Fri, 11 Mar 2016 22:27:26 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=72826&start=290&SessionId=9be3b5105826c14f070e9bcf6e38954f
> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.230.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf44b98f1468999148d91a812f92a834","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"PuntaCanaBride14\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank-you! We truly had a great day :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1. The spa has four stations for hair\/makeup. They started with the moms and my sister in law at 1000. Then did my two bridesmaids and flower girl. My hair started at 1200. Five of us had our makeup done and we were all finished by 1:45.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They do speak spanish, but are pretty good with English. A couple of us showed them pictures for hair and they were pretty good with doing what we asked for. I had read somewhere that they used MAC makeup, but this is not the case.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I did like my hair and makeup, but I wasn&#039;t \"in love\" with it. But really, I was pampered and didn&#039;t have to do it myself! The big thing with my hair (which wasn&#039;t the spas fault) was that the flower I had ordered for my hair was a white lily that was as big as my hand. I had envisioned a colourful tropical flower so my advice would be to specify what flower you want when ordering!! I ended up getting my wedding coordinator to get a new one (which I had to pay for) that was just ok, nothing great.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The ladies in the spa were great with doing touchups on hair and they were amazing with my flowergirl. They definitely made her feel like a princess.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. The bridal suite is well worth the money in my opinion. Its a room just off of the salon. You get bottles of champagne and plates of fruit. For us it provided us with somewhere to hang out in between hair &amp;amp; makeup sessions and then after we were ready but before the ceremony. It has A\/C so that was perfect for before the ceremony we didn&#039;t have to stand around and melt! There is a bathroom in there and a pedestal with floor length mirrors for you put your dress on. Great place for pictures!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will alert you that there is a Scentsy on the floor in the bathroom so be careful if you go in there in your dress. I didn&#039;t see it and got wax all over the train of my dress before the ceremony. Luckily it wiped right off of the tulle!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. We had a very small and informal rehearsal. It was not booked through our wedding coordinator. We just met at the fountain area and practiced the order of the processional. I think the one you book with the wedding coordinator includes cocktails and light snacks for the same price as the cocktail hour.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4. It depends on the time of your ceremony and the number of bridesmaids. We started at 10am and my ceremony was at 3pm. We were all ready around 1:45 and that was for 7 hair and 5 makeup. I was actually a little concerned that 10am was too early for us to get ready because I didn&#039;t want hair\/makeup to be flat\/ruined by 3pm. For us I think it worked out pretty well. We had enough time to hang out, exchange&amp;nbsp;gifts&amp;nbsp;and get some group pictures and we didn&#039;t feel rushed at all. My husband and I did the \"first look\" photos at 2pm so everything worked out well for us.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!! I hope you have a fantastic day :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834719,"PostDate":1392868365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276248\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276248-puntacanabride14\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">PuntaCanaBride14<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank-you! We truly had a great day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1. The spa has four stations for hair\/makeup. They started with the moms and my sister in law at 1000. Then did my two bridesmaids and flower girl. My hair started at 1200. Five of us had our makeup done and we were all finished by 1:45.<\/p>\n<p>They do speak spanish, but are pretty good with English. A couple of us showed them pictures for hair and they were pretty good with doing what we asked for. I had read somewhere that they used MAC makeup, but this is not the case.<\/p>\n<p>I did like my hair and makeup, but I wasn't \"in love\" with it. But really, I was pampered and didn't have to do it myself! The big thing with my hair (which wasn't the spas fault) was that the flower I had ordered for my hair was a white lily that was as big as my hand. I had envisioned a colourful tropical flower so my advice would be to specify what flower you want when ordering!! I ended up getting my wedding coordinator to get a new one (which I had to pay for) that was just ok, nothing great.<\/p>\n<p>The ladies in the spa were great with doing touchups on hair and they were amazing with my flowergirl. They definitely made her feel like a princess.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2. The bridal suite is well worth the money in my opinion. Its a room just off of the salon. You get bottles of champagne and plates of fruit. For us it provided us with somewhere to hang out in between hair & makeup sessions and then after we were ready but before the ceremony. It has A\/C so that was perfect for before the ceremony we didn't have to stand around and melt! There is a bathroom in there and a pedestal with floor length mirrors for you put your dress on. Great place for pictures!<\/p>\n<p>I will alert you that there is a Scentsy on the floor in the bathroom so be careful if you go in there in your dress. I didn't see it and got wax all over the train of my dress before the ceremony. Luckily it wiped right off of the tulle!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3. We had a very small and informal rehearsal. It was not booked through our wedding coordinator. We just met at the fountain area and practiced the order of the processional. I think the one you book with the wedding coordinator includes cocktails and light snacks for the same price as the cocktail hour.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>4. It depends on the time of your ceremony and the number of bridesmaids. We started at 10am and my ceremony was at 3pm. We were all ready around 1:45 and that was for 7 hair and 5 makeup. I was actually a little concerned that 10am was too early for us to get ready because I didn't want hair\/makeup to be flat\/ruined by 3pm. For us I think it worked out pretty well. We had enough time to hang out, exchange\u00a0gifts\u00a0and get some group pictures and we didn't feel rushed at all. My husband and I did the \"first look\" photos at 2pm so everything worked out well for us.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!! I hope you have a fantastic day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357849978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.162.85.197","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10ea56171dc8d12e63e26f3b52228ecd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;@ Kristina Simms&lt;\/sup&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Awesome! Thanks again Kristina! I&#039;m so excited!! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/sup&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834732,"PostDate":1392889264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><sup>@ Kristina Simms<\/sup><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><sup>Awesome! Thanks again Kristina! I'm so excited!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/sup><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelina_plichie_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.162.72.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390329994,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276248.jpg?_r=1395191656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PuntaCanaBride14","Id":276248,"Name":"PuntaCanaBride14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.157.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0341466636a5b2843b3e3a45b8da87c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are a team of two wedding photographers based in Punta Cana!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Now Larimar is one of our favorite resorts, so if you are still looking for a wedding photographer or have any questions, don&#039;t hesitate to e-mail me at julia@juliaeskin.com ! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve photographed number of weddings at Now Larimar and all of them were absolutely gorgeous!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834806,"PostDate":1392911522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are a team of two wedding photographers based in Punta Cana!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Now Larimar is one of our favorite resorts, so if you are still looking for a wedding photographer or have any questions, don't hesitate to e-mail me at julia@juliaeskin.com ! \u00a0I've photographed number of weddings at Now Larimar and all of them were absolutely gorgeous!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000080;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Creative documentary wedding photographer in Punta Cana!<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.juliaeskin.com'>www.juliaeskin.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"julia@juliaeskin.com","IpAddress":"187.153.56.51","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1270564442,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227096.jpg?_r=1392861573","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Julia Eskin","Id":227096,"Name":"Julia Eskin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.162.69.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46e3b783a7914f37672256f2bc7dc85e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Brides,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m looking into a videographer for our wedding in May! I was wondering if anybody has any suggestions or good&amp;nbsp;prices?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your help :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1835143,"PostDate":1393065406,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Brides,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm looking into a videographer for our wedding in May! I was wondering if anybody has any suggestions or good\u00a0prices?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for your help <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelina_plichie_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.162.72.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390329994,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276248.jpg?_r=1395191656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PuntaCanaBride14","Id":276248,"Name":"PuntaCanaBride14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.29.211.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cce2f6a84c35f750ad66ea306e1435de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies!!! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is so fun reading all of your posts. &amp;nbsp;Does anyone know how strict they are with their restaurant dress codes? &amp;nbsp;My guys are not too fond of wearing pants every night...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, did anyone have, or is anyone planning to have, a traditional long head table? &amp;nbsp;I want a long enough table for 14 people... is that unreasonable for a poolside reception?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;June 6, 2014 wedding :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1836083,"PostDate":1393623792,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies!!! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is so fun reading all of your posts. \u00a0Does anyone know how strict they are with their restaurant dress codes? \u00a0My guys are not too fond of wearing pants every night...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, did anyone have, or is anyone planning to have, a traditional long head table? \u00a0I want a long enough table for 14 people... is that unreasonable for a poolside reception?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>June 6, 2014 wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bethlorentz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.88.29.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375533315,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272212.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bethlorentz","Id":272212,"Name":"bethlorentz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c35c20f46366876b18be54922da62d97","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"lwozniak888\"] Congrats on your wedding:) What items for decorating did you take? And did you have to pay any fees for doing so?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837186,"PostDate":1394201092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268529\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/268529-lwozniak888\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lwozniak888<\/span><\/a> Congrats on your wedding:) What items for decorating did you take? And did you have to pay any fees for doing so?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"425c25d911c9017e9bd0a616cf148fe6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"bride473473\"] Congrats on the big day:) where did you get the STD&#039;s made up? That&#039;s an awesome idea.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837203,"PostDate":1394206861,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"269745\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/269745-bride473473\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bride473473<\/span><\/a> Congrats on the big day:) where did you get the STD's made up? That's an awesome idea.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.39.231.84","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ebf973b8659a22444944b04791e2eb1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Kristina Simms\" post=\"1834719\" timestamp=\"1392886365\"]\n@[member=\"PuntaCanaBride14\"]\n\nThank-you! We truly had a great day :)\n\n1. The spa has four stations for hair\/makeup. They started with the moms and my sister in law at 1000. Then did my two bridesmaids and flower girl. My hair started at 1200. Five of us had our makeup done and we were all finished by 1:45.\nThey do speak spanish, but are pretty good with English. A couple of us showed them pictures for hair and they were pretty good with doing what we asked for. I had read somewhere that they used MAC makeup, but this is not the case.\nI did like my hair and makeup, but I wasn&#039;t \"in love\" with it. But really, I was pampered and didn&#039;t have to do it myself! The big thing with my hair (which wasn&#039;t the spas fault) was that the flower I had ordered for my hair was a white lily that was as big as my hand. I had envisioned a colourful tropical flower so my advice would be to specify what flower you want when ordering!! I ended up getting my wedding coordinator to get a new one (which I had to pay for) that was just ok, nothing great.\nThe ladies in the spa were great with doing touchups on hair and they were amazing with my flowergirl. They definitely made her feel like a princess.\n\n2. The bridal suite is well worth the money in my opinion. Its a room just off of the salon. You get bottles of champagne and plates of fruit. For us it provided us with somewhere to hang out in between hair &amp;amp; makeup sessions and then after we were ready but before the ceremony. It has A\/C so that was perfect for before the ceremony we didn&#039;t have to stand around and melt! There is a bathroom in there and a pedestal with floor length mirrors for you put your dress on. Great place for pictures!\nI will alert you that there is a Scentsy on the floor in the bathroom so be careful if you go in there in your dress. I didn&#039;t see it and got wax all over the train of my dress before the ceremony. Luckily it wiped right off of the tulle!\n\n3. We had a very small and informal rehearsal. It was not booked through our wedding coordinator. We just met at the fountain area and practiced the order of the processional. I think the one you book with the wedding coordinator includes cocktails and light snacks for the same price as the cocktail hour.\n\n4. It depends on the time of your ceremony and the number of bridesmaids. We started at 10am and my ceremony was at 3pm. We were all ready around 1:45 and that was for 7 hair and 5 makeup. I was actually a little concerned that 10am was too early for us to get ready because I didn&#039;t want hair\/makeup to be flat\/ruined by 3pm. For us I think it worked out pretty well. We had enough time to hang out, exchange gifts and get some group pictures and we didn&#039;t feel rushed at all. My husband and I did the \"first look\" photos at 2pm so everything worked out well for us.\n\n\nGood luck!! I hope you have a fantastic day :)[\/quote]Kristina, thank yo so much for posting this. My wedding is on May 17 and, although I have been reviewing this website from time to time, I have never posted anything. I was having a breakdown day today... just overwhelmed with too many things... but your post made me feel so much better. Thank you so much for assuring us that everything will work out in the end. Your reassurance is more helpful than you know! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1837249,"PostDate":1394225362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kristina Simms, on 20 February 2014 - 03:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276248\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276248-puntacanabride14\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">PuntaCanaBride14<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank-you! We truly had a great day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1. The spa has four stations for hair\/makeup. They started with the moms and my sister in law at 1000. Then did my two bridesmaids and flower girl. My hair started at 1200. Five of us had our makeup done and we were all finished by 1:45.<\/p>\n<p>They do speak spanish, but are pretty good with English. A couple of us showed them pictures for hair and they were pretty good with doing what we asked for. I had read somewhere that they used MAC makeup, but this is not the case.<\/p>\n<p>I did like my hair and makeup, but I wasn't \"in love\" with it. But really, I was pampered and didn't have to do it myself! The big thing with my hair (which wasn't the spas fault) was that the flower I had ordered for my hair was a white lily that was as big as my hand. I had envisioned a colourful tropical flower so my advice would be to specify what flower you want when ordering!! I ended up getting my wedding coordinator to get a new one (which I had to pay for) that was just ok, nothing great.<\/p>\n<p>The ladies in the spa were great with doing touchups on hair and they were amazing with my flowergirl. They definitely made her feel like a princess.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2. The bridal suite is well worth the money in my opinion. Its a room just off of the salon. You get bottles of champagne and plates of fruit. For us it provided us with somewhere to hang out in between hair & makeup sessions and then after we were ready but before the ceremony. It has A\/C so that was perfect for before the ceremony we didn't have to stand around and melt! There is a bathroom in there and a pedestal with floor length mirrors for you put your dress on. Great place for pictures!<\/p>\n<p>I will alert you that there is a Scentsy on the floor in the bathroom so be careful if you go in there in your dress. I didn't see it and got wax all over the train of my dress before the ceremony. Luckily it wiped right off of the tulle!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3. We had a very small and informal rehearsal. It was not booked through our wedding coordinator. We just met at the fountain area and practiced the order of the processional. I think the one you book with the wedding coordinator includes cocktails and light snacks for the same price as the cocktail hour.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>4. It depends on the time of your ceremony and the number of bridesmaids. We started at 10am and my ceremony was at 3pm. We were all ready around 1:45 and that was for 7 hair and 5 makeup. I was actually a little concerned that 10am was too early for us to get ready because I didn't want hair\/makeup to be flat\/ruined by 3pm. For us I think it worked out pretty well. We had enough time to hang out, exchange\u00a0gifts\u00a0and get some group pictures and we didn't feel rushed at all. My husband and I did the \"first look\" photos at 2pm so everything worked out well for us.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!! I hope you have a fantastic day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Kristina, thank yo so much for posting this. My wedding is on May 17 and, although I have been reviewing this website from time to time, I have never posted anything. I was having a breakdown day today... just overwhelmed with too many things...\u00a0but your post made me feel so much better. Thank you so much for assuring us that everything will work out in the end. Your reassurance is more helpful than you know! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tamika_nicole@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.129.78.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373129531,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271242.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DestiBride","Id":271242,"Name":"DestiBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1457bcfae00c262f417cf72770bd3101","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This board is sooo fun; I have spent the last hour reading all about NOW!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I booked my wedding tonight - me and my beau are getting married December 5th, 2014!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Looking forward to chatting more with you ladies as the panic starts to set in...ha&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks,&amp;nbsp; J&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837464,"PostDate":1394394527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This board is sooo fun; I have spent the last hour reading all about NOW!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I booked my wedding tonight - me and my beau are getting married December 5th, 2014!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Looking forward to chatting more with you ladies as the panic starts to set in...ha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks,\u00a0 J<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"precious_jess@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"208.87.237.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389902988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276145.jpg?_r=1395750370","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Jessica2015","Id":276145,"Name":"Jessica2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.162.70.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2dacdac7296aef145347044e26afedd5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Brides,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve been trying to book the Bridal Suite next to the Spa for&amp;nbsp;over one month&amp;nbsp;now, and they won&#039;t email me back. Our Wedding Day is May 7th. Can somebody please help! I&#039;ve been emailing 2 different email addresses&amp;nbsp;(girls at the Spa).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839350,"PostDate":1395248611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Brides,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've been trying to book the Bridal Suite next to the Spa for\u00a0over one month\u00a0now, and they won't email me back. Our Wedding Day is May 7th. Can somebody please help! I've been emailing 2 different email addresses\u00a0(girls at the Spa).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelina_plichie_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.162.72.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390329994,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276248.jpg?_r=1395191656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PuntaCanaBride14","Id":276248,"Name":"PuntaCanaBride14","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":290,"NextPage":300,"PreviousPage":280,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
