> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"485da078ea2c73ba5834205a7b9abcc7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276248-puntacanabride14\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;PuntaCanaBride14&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Did you email &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com&#039;&gt;spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;? I emailed them back in January for my&amp;nbsp;August wedding&amp;nbsp;and got a response the next day. The spa&#039;s assistant who replied to me is Vanessa Disla. Worst case scenario, her phone number listed&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;809-221-4646 Ext 7755. Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272212-bethlorentz\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;bethlorentz&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Your day will be here soon! I don&#039;t think it&#039;s unreasonable; I would just consider the size of your entire group before determining if that&#039;s what you want. We have 14 people as well for our entire bridal party, but didn&#039;t think we should have the long table because we only thought that maybe 40 people would go total, and we didn&#039;t want the place to look empty. LOL. So we decided to do the sweetheart table which is included in the Divine Package. Now we found out that so far 73 people are booked.... YIKES! But we aren&#039;t changing our minds about the table because we want everyone to mingle with everyone else! Hope my thoughts help!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839444,"PostDate":1395309843,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276248-puntacanabride14\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>PuntaCanaBride14<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0Did you email <a href='mailto:spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com<\/a>? I emailed them back in January for my\u00a0August wedding\u00a0and got a response the next day. The spa's assistant who replied to me is Vanessa Disla. Worst case scenario, her phone number listed\u00a0is\u00a0809-221-4646 Ext 7755. Good luck!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272212-bethlorentz\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>bethlorentz<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0Your day will be here soon! I don't think it's unreasonable; I would just consider the size of your entire group before determining if that's what you want. We have 14 people as well for our entire bridal party, but didn't think we should have the long table because we only thought that maybe 40 people would go total, and we didn't want the place to look empty. LOL. So we decided to do the sweetheart table which is included in the Divine Package. Now we found out that so far 73 people are booked.... YIKES! But we aren't changing our minds about the table because we want everyone to mingle with everyone else! Hope my thoughts help!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.29.211.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6fd0907fdb9b6b715118c47b6105327a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1839444\" timestamp=\"1395327843\"]\n@[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276248-puntacanabride14\/\"]PuntaCanaBride14[\/url] Did you email [email=\"spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com\"]spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com[\/email]? I emailed them back in January for my August wedding and got a response the next day. The spa&#039;s assistant who replied to me is Vanessa Disla. Worst case scenario, her phone number listed is 809-221-4646 Ext 7755. Good luck!\n\n@[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272212-bethlorentz\/\"]bethlorentz[\/url] Your day will be here soon! I don&#039;t think it&#039;s unreasonable; I would just consider the size of your entire group before determining if that&#039;s what you want. We have 14 people as well for our entire bridal party, but didn&#039;t think we should have the long table because we only thought that maybe 40 people would go total, and we didn&#039;t want the place to look empty. LOL. So we decided to do the sweetheart table which is included in the Divine Package. Now we found out that so far 73 people are booked.... YIKES! But we aren&#039;t changing our minds about the table because we want everyone to mingle with everyone else! Hope my thoughts help![\/quote]Thanks for your input, I really appreciate it!  I might wait to make the final decision until I see the reception space by the pool!  My big day is coming so quickly!  I can&#039;t believe you have 73 confirmed guests already, that is awesome!!!  We are pretty set on our number, with only 4 people still up in the air, and we will have 35.  I am getting so excited!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1839610,"PostDate":1395348370,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>duchovny0901, on 20 March 2014 - 10:04 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276248-puntacanabride14\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>PuntaCanaBride14<\/a>\u00a0Did you email <a href='mailto:spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>spa1.serpc@secretsresorts.com<\/a>? I emailed them back in January for my\u00a0August wedding\u00a0and got a response the next day. The spa's assistant who replied to me is Vanessa Disla. Worst case scenario, her phone number listed\u00a0is\u00a0809-221-4646 Ext 7755. Good luck!<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272212-bethlorentz\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>bethlorentz<\/a>\u00a0Your day will be here soon! I don't think it's unreasonable; I would just consider the size of your entire group before determining if that's what you want. We have 14 people as well for our entire bridal party, but didn't think we should have the long table because we only thought that maybe 40 people would go total, and we didn't want the place to look empty. LOL. So we decided to do the sweetheart table which is included in the Divine Package. Now we found out that so far 73 people are booked.... YIKES! But we aren't changing our minds about the table because we want everyone to mingle with everyone else! Hope my thoughts help!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks for your input, I really appreciate it! \u00a0I might wait to make the final decision until I see the reception space by the pool! \u00a0My big day is coming so quickly! \u00a0I can't believe you have 73 confirmed guests already, that is awesome!!! \u00a0We are pretty set on our number, with only 4 people still up in the air, and we will have 35. \u00a0I am getting so excited!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bethlorentz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.88.29.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375533315,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272212.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bethlorentz","Id":272212,"Name":"bethlorentz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"146.90.17.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f478f9f799d1d5715229d69bcc37df7a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Not long for me now.... 8th April big day :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839647,"PostDate":1395391734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Not long for me now.... 8th April big day :-)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amyevans_5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"84.93.51.41","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367308245,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269144.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AMYEVANS","Id":269144,"Name":"AMYEVANS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.76.184.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2afea35fe5bc6939c082f2243d03030","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello everyone. I am considering the Now Larimar for my destination wedding in March 2015. I am trying to decide between this resort and the Dreams Punta Cana. Any advice to help me decide?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839978,"PostDate":1395602916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello everyone. I am considering the Now Larimar for my destination wedding in March 2015. I am trying to decide between this resort and the Dreams Punta Cana. Any advice to help me decide?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a_jansen1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.76.184.146","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1395474327,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ajansen1","Id":277283,"Name":"ajansen1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.39.231.84","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c63f09e84edc9b887cb01339c263d4e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My date is May 17! I know there&#039;s someone out there with the same date because when I requested the fountain for the ceremony it was \"unavailable\" lol... so beachfront it is! Congrats to all of the ladies on this forum :) It&#039;s nice to have somewhere to go where I know that everyone is dealing with the same happiness, frustrations, excitement and stress as I am&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840761,"PostDate":1395867753,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My date is May 17! I know there's someone out there with the same date because when I requested the fountain for the ceremony it was \"unavailable\" lol... so beachfront it is! Congrats to all of the ladies on this forum <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> It's nice to have somewhere to go where I know that everyone is dealing with the same happiness, frustrations, excitement and stress as I am\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tamika_nicole@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.129.78.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373129531,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271242.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DestiBride","Id":271242,"Name":"DestiBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"236225ba6458f7afd57cd780603202c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrsFountain2B\"] Hey just wondering if you&#039;ve booked your flights yet?! I found out that AirTran Airlines is the only company that offers nonstop flights to and from Punta Cana. We originally were going to come down on Tuesday 8\/26 or Wednesday 8\/27 but those flights weren&#039;t nonstop, so we decided to come in on Monday 8\/25! Now we&#039;re staying&amp;nbsp;until Tuesday&amp;nbsp;9\/2. Now that we&#039;ve got that out the way, we&#039;re trying to figure out how we&#039;re going to bring all of our d\u00e9cor down there without paying a bunch of fees! LOL&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ajansen1\"] Hey and congrats on the upcoming destination wedding! I had the same dilemma with deciding between those resorts. Dreams was a place that everyone had been to on vacation to and raved about it. We had to look at our wedding guest group type to decide; I think Dreams might have been no kids (correct me if I&#039;m wrong) and right now we have 9 children confirmed. It looked to me that Now had more on-site activities too (game room, casino, more restaurants, etc).&amp;nbsp;Additionally, their negotiated room prices for the amount of guests that we were more expensive. Also, the wedding package offered with Now was more appealing to me than Dreams. I hope this helps in your decision!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841207,"PostDate":1396084269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271063\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271063-mrsfountain2b\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrsFountain2B<\/span><\/a> Hey just wondering if you've booked your flights yet?! I found out that AirTran Airlines is the only company that offers nonstop flights to and from Punta Cana. We originally were going to come down on Tuesday 8\/26 or Wednesday 8\/27 but those flights weren't nonstop, so we decided to come in on Monday 8\/25! Now we're staying\u00a0until Tuesday\u00a09\/2. Now that we've got that out the way, we're trying to figure out how we're going to bring all of our d\u00e9cor down there without paying a bunch of fees! LOL<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277283-ajansen1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ajansen1<\/span><\/a> Hey and congrats on the upcoming destination wedding! I had the same dilemma with deciding between those resorts. Dreams was a place that everyone had been to on vacation to and raved about it. We had to look at our wedding guest group type to decide; I think Dreams might have been no kids (correct me if I'm wrong) and right now we have 9 children confirmed. It looked to me that Now had more on-site activities too (game room, casino, more restaurants, etc).\u00a0Additionally, their negotiated room prices for the amount of guests that we were more expensive. Also, the wedding package offered with Now was more appealing to me than Dreams. I hope this helps in your decision!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.231.234.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93a1380e5cf3ca0b1d0761c7243f51be","RawContent":"Do any of you know - if you have to be there for 3 days before the wedding regardless of ceremony type, if the day you land counts?  If we were to land on a Tuesday, could we get married on Friday?  Or would it have to be the Saturday?  \n\n\nThanks","Attachments":[],"Id":1841225,"PostDate":1396092532,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Do any of you know - if you have to be there for 3 days before the wedding regardless of ceremony type, if the day you land counts?  If we were to land on a Tuesday, could we get married on Friday?  Or would it have to be the Saturday?  <br><br>\nThanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danamarielouise@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.89.226.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393257767,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Danamarielouise","Id":276863,"Name":"Danamarielouise","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.185.71.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0281657c890f6aa4fe7097ae5bf9b525","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ajansen1\" post=\"1839978\" timestamp=\"1395620916\"]\nHello everyone. I am considering the Now Larimar for my destination wedding in March 2015. I am trying to decide between this resort and the Dreams Punta Cana. Any advice to help me decide?\n\nThanks.[\/quote]\nI&#039;ve photographed weddings at both resorts and both are really great!  \nNow Larimar has a great beach, I think it&#039;s a little smaller resort as well.  \nDreams Punta Cana is beautiful too with gorgeous garden gazebo (doesn&#039;t matter if you are considering a beach ceremony).  The other thing to consider is the beach at Dreams Punta Cana has pretty big waves most of the time, while the one at Now Larimar is a lot quieter most of the year (depends on the season of course).  Only matters if you like to swim in the ocean. \nHope this helps a little!","Attachments":[],"Id":1841234,"PostDate":1396099767,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ajansen1, on 23 March 2014 - 07:28 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello everyone. I am considering the Now Larimar for my destination wedding in March 2015. I am trying to decide between this resort and the Dreams Punta Cana. Any advice to help me decide?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've photographed weddings at both resorts and both are really great! \u00a0<br>\nNow Larimar has a great beach, I think it's a little smaller resort as well. \u00a0<br>\nDreams Punta Cana is beautiful too with gorgeous garden gazebo (doesn't matter if you are considering a beach ceremony). \u00a0The other thing to consider is the beach at Dreams Punta Cana has pretty big waves most of the time, while the one at Now Larimar is a lot quieter most of the year (depends on the season of course). \u00a0Only matters if you like to swim in the ocean.\u00a0<br>\nHope this helps a little!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000080;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Creative documentary wedding photographer in Punta Cana!<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.juliaeskin.com'>www.juliaeskin.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"julia@juliaeskin.com","IpAddress":"187.153.56.51","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1270564442,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227096.jpg?_r=1392861573","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Julia Eskin","Id":227096,"Name":"Julia Eskin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.58.181.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3067cfbcdab52e2ddee610c376325699","RawContent":"Hey ladies! I am wanting a destination wedding in 2015 in the DR. I have looked at so many resorts but keep coming back to Now! This forum has helped seal the deal, Now Laimar it is!  Has anyone gone through Apple vacations as a travel agent?  We currently are talking to a destination wedding specialist through them.  They require a large deposit for booking a block of rooms that then goes towards the wedding.  I am uneasy about this because at this point we do not know how many people will for sure come and if you hold too many rooms that you don&#039;t use, you lose money.  If anyone has had good or bad experiences with Apple Vacations I would love your input!  I am very excited about Now because I love the fountain area!","Attachments":[],"Id":1841246,"PostDate":1396106992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies! I am wanting a destination wedding in 2015 in the DR. I have looked at so many resorts but keep coming back to Now! This forum has helped seal the deal, Now Laimar it is!  Has anyone gone through Apple vacations as a travel agent?  We currently are talking to a destination wedding specialist through them.  They require a large deposit for booking a block of rooms that then goes towards the wedding.  I am uneasy about this because at this point we do not know how many people will for sure come and if you hold too many rooms that you don't use, you lose money.  If anyone has had good or bad experiences with Apple Vacations I would love your input!  I am very excited about Now because I love the fountain area! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rossiteremilyk@sau.edu","IpAddress":"70.58.181.208","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396105334,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"EmilyR","Id":277397,"Name":"EmilyR","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.134.153.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06ded23fca013f110e280651fdcb45cc","RawContent":"@[member=\"EmilyR\"] Hey and congrats on getting married! This site has helped a great deal for me deciding on Now and im less than 6 months out now! I looked around for travel agents too and went with Wright Travel Agency from this site. They&#039;ve handled everything so far; booking flights and resort rooms for my guests, negotiating room prices and getting us promos. Also they provide transport to and from the airport for all guests.  They also keep me updated with how many people have booked and if I need to secure more. They just required $100 per room and for oir promo I had to secure a minimum 6 rooms. Thats it!I secured 20 initially with our estimate but more people have booked and the agency took it upon themselves to contact the resort and get more, while making sure we received the samegroup rate! Im so glad that I decided to go with them because this is so much less stress! Check out their reviews on this site, and good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1841290,"PostDate":1396167308,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277397\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277397-emilyr\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">EmilyR<\/span><\/a> Hey and congrats on getting married! This site has helped a great deal for me deciding on Now and im less than 6 months out now! I looked around for travel agents too and went with Wright Travel Agency from this site. They've handled everything so far; booking flights and resort rooms for my guests, negotiating room prices and getting us promos. Also they provide transport to and from the airport for all guests.  They also keep me updated with how many people have booked and if I need to secure more. They just required $100 per room and for oir promo I had to secure a minimum 6 rooms. Thats it!I secured 20 initially with our estimate but more people have booked and the agency took it upon themselves to contact the resort and get more, while making sure we received the samegroup rate! Im so glad that I decided to go with them because this is so much less stress! Check out their reviews on this site, and good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":300,"NextPage":310,"PreviousPage":290,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
