{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62cf824c66f79ad6011c9623beec3b24","RawContent":"@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] What decor do you plan to take? If you don&#039;t mind my asking.\n[quote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1841290\" timestamp=\"1396185308\"]\n@[member=\"EmilyR\"] Hey and congrats on getting married! This site has helped a great deal for me deciding on Now and im less than 6 months out now! I looked around for travel agents too and went with Wright Travel Agency from this site. They&#039;ve handled everything so far; booking flights and resort rooms for my guests, negotiating room prices and getting us promos. Also they provide transport to and from the airport for all guests. They also keep me updated with how many people have booked and if I need to secure more. They just required $100 per room and for oir promo I had to secure a minimum 6 rooms. Thats it!I secured 20 initially with our estimate but more people have booked and the agency took it upon themselves to contact the resort and get more, while making sure we received the samegroup rate! Im so glad that I decided to go with them because this is so much less stress! Check out their reviews on this site, and good luck![\/quote]Thanks for this info!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1841442,"PostDate":1396253869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> What decor do you plan to take? If you don't mind my asking.<\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>duchovny0901, on 30 March 2014 - 08:15 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277397\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277397-emilyr\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">EmilyR<\/span><\/a> Hey and congrats on getting married! This site has helped a great deal for me deciding on Now and im less than 6 months out now! I looked around for travel agents too and went with Wright Travel Agency from this site. They've handled everything so far; booking flights and resort rooms for my guests, negotiating room prices and getting us promos. Also they provide transport to and from the airport for all guests. They also keep me updated with how many people have booked and if I need to secure more. They just required $100 per room and for oir promo I had to secure a minimum 6 rooms. Thats it!I secured 20 initially with our estimate but more people have booked and the agency took it upon themselves to contact the resort and get more, while making sure we received the samegroup rate! Im so glad that I decided to go with them because this is so much less stress! Check out their reviews on this site, and good luck!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks for this info!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.237.105.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9f2f19ee5f22f67c693eb53238e3ae3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] No problem! I am planning to take our chair sashes, sand ceremony items and our&amp;nbsp;DIY centerpieces, so basically all the d\u00e9cor. LOL. We&#039;re also gonna bring our OOT bags and goodies, along with our bridal party gifts.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841597,"PostDate":1396278741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> No problem! I am planning to take our chair sashes, sand ceremony items and our\u00a0DIY centerpieces, so basically all the d\u00e9cor. LOL. We're also gonna bring our OOT bags and goodies, along with our bridal party gifts.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab51e8f313559e1862e19d2c1c78dfef","RawContent":"[quote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1841597\" timestamp=\"1396296741\"]\n@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] No problem! I am planning to take our chair sashes, sand ceremony items and our DIY centerpieces, so basically all the d\u00e9cor. LOL. We&#039;re also gonna bring our OOT bags and goodies, along with our bridal party gifts.[\/quote]This may sound like a silly question, but i&#039;m gonna ask. LOL.....What is an OOT bag?\n[quote name=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\" post=\"1841802\" timestamp=\"1396356314\"]\nThis may sound like a silly question, but i&#039;m gonna ask. LOL.....What is an OOT bag?[\/quote]One more question. Are they charging you for bringing your own decor?","Attachments":[],"Id":1841802,"PostDate":1396338570,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>duchovny0901, on 31 March 2014 - 03:12 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> No problem! I am planning to take our chair sashes, sand ceremony items and our\u00a0DIY centerpieces, so basically all the d\u00e9cor. LOL. We're also gonna bring our OOT bags and goodies, along with our bridal party gifts.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>This may sound like a silly question, but i'm gonna ask. LOL.....What is an OOT bag?<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MrandMrsBonitto2016, on 01 April 2014 - 07:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>This may sound like a silly question, but i'm gonna ask. LOL.....What is an OOT bag?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>One more question. Are they charging you for bringing your own decor?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.64.56","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69a1add58f3aa19c1a0aec5fe6667516","RawContent":"@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] OOT is \"Out Of Town\". Don&#039;t worry it took me a second to figure that out too!\n\n\nAnd tthey do charge $1 per sash to set up, which is ok for me because I ended up purchasing them for $.50 a piece and can hopefully give them to someone else. Centerpieces are charged $30 per table to setup. i believe that the minimum cost for a basic centerpiece rental is $80, and the pics I saw of what they had for that price was not flying with me. Lol. We wanted to make our own to go with our theme (beachy) and save some cash. Plus someone else can use these items too!","Attachments":[],"Id":1841810,"PostDate":1396340149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> OOT is \"Out Of Town\". Don't worry it took me a second to figure that out too!<br><br>\nAnd tthey do charge $1 per sash to set up, which is ok for me because I ended up purchasing them for $.50 a piece and can hopefully give them to someone else. Centerpieces are charged $30 per table to setup. i believe that the minimum cost for a basic centerpiece rental is $80, and the pics I saw of what they had for that price was not flying with me. Lol. We wanted to make our own to go with our theme (beachy) and save some cash. Plus someone else can use these items too!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"813399804bdf0ff5477332dd5cff74a6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1841810\" timestamp=\"1396358149\"]\n@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] OOT is \"Out Of Town\". Don&#039;t worry it took me a second to figure that out too!\n\nAnd tthey do charge $1 per sash to set up, which is ok for me because I ended up purchasing them for $.50 a piece and can hopefully give them to someone else. Centerpieces are charged $30 per table to setup. i believe that the minimum cost for a basic centerpiece rental is $80, and the pics I saw of what they had for that price was not flying with me. Lol. We wanted to make our own to go with our theme (beachy) and save some cash. Plus someone else can use these items too![\/quote]Very true! where did you purchase the sashes?","Attachments":[],"Id":1841813,"PostDate":1396340627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>duchovny0901, on 01 April 2014 - 08:15 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> OOT is \"Out Of Town\". Don't worry it took me a second to figure that out too!<br><br>\nAnd tthey do charge $1 per sash to set up, which is ok for me because I ended up purchasing them for $.50 a piece and can hopefully give them to someone else. Centerpieces are charged $30 per table to setup. i believe that the minimum cost for a basic centerpiece rental is $80, and the pics I saw of what they had for that price was not flying with me. Lol. We wanted to make our own to go with our theme (beachy) and save some cash. Plus someone else can use these items too!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Very true! where did you purchase the sashes?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.237.105.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bacc68a52cc38e3aeeeb54c705dfe12","RawContent":"@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] www.bbcrafts.com I ordered samples first (they have a link for just purchasing sample sashes to check out the color). My sashes are purplr organza.","Attachments":[],"Id":1841815,"PostDate":1396341102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> www.bbcrafts.com I ordered samples first (they have a link for just purchasing sample sashes to check out the color). My sashes are purplr organza. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aea3c582a0a49d96392ce2f638d079eb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1841815\" timestamp=\"1396359102\"]\n@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] www.bbcrafts.com I ordered samples first (they have a link for just purchasing sample sashes to check out the color). My sashes are purplr organza.[\/quote]Thank you so much for answering my questions:) I just want to be ahead of the game. LOL......actually one more question. I think I read you are using a travel agent, did you find it helpful?","Attachments":[],"Id":1841817,"PostDate":1396341326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>duchovny0901, on 01 April 2014 - 08:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> www.bbcrafts.com I ordered samples first (they have a link for just purchasing sample sashes to check out the color). My sashes are purplr organza.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you so much for answering my questions:) I just want to be ahead of the game. LOL......actually one more question. I think I read you are using a travel agent, did you find it helpful?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.126.209.43","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f919d3613846ab76770994e72a6b0d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m new to the site and just wanted to say hello! I love reading all the posts. I know this is for 2014 weddings but I have mine booked at the Now Larimar for January 15, 2015! I can&#039;t wait. I am starting to get overwhelmed with the planning process. I did receive an email from my wedding coordinator Luisa with some basic information but I have sooooo many other questions!! Can any of you give me any advice? Right now I&#039;m concerned about flower arrangements and decorations? We plan on bringing&amp;nbsp;ALOT of decorations down to DO. My wedding coordinator said they charge a 25% set up fee for all decorations??? 25% of what....my wedding package?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If any of you could tell me what you&#039;ve experienced so far with the planning process that would be great!! :D&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Michelle&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841886,"PostDate":1396359857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm new to the site and just wanted to say hello! I love reading all the posts. I know this is for 2014 weddings but I have mine booked at the Now Larimar for January 15, 2015! I can't wait. I am starting to get overwhelmed with the planning process. I did receive an email from my wedding coordinator Luisa with some basic information but I have sooooo many other questions!! Can any of you give me any advice? Right now I'm concerned about flower arrangements and decorations? We plan on bringing\u00a0ALOT of decorations down to DO. My wedding coordinator said they charge a 25% set up fee for all decorations??? 25% of what....my wedding package?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If any of you could tell me what you've experienced so far with the planning process that would be great!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much,<\/p>\n<p>Michelle<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mpietsch@uwm.edu","IpAddress":"206.126.209.43","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396359195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mpietsch","Id":277443,"Name":"mpietsch","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a58617c8287ec3b9570fb58b512626c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mpietsch\" post=\"1841886\" timestamp=\"1396377857\"]\nHello ladies!\n\nI&#039;m new to the site and just wanted to say hello! I love reading all the posts. I know this is for 2014 weddings but I have mine booked at the Now Larimar for January 15, 2015! I can&#039;t wait. I am starting to get overwhelmed with the planning process. I did receive an email from my wedding coordinator Luisa with some basic information but I have sooooo many other questions!! Can any of you give me any advice? Right now I&#039;m concerned about flower arrangements and decorations? We plan on bringing ALOT of decorations down to DO. My wedding coordinator said they charge a 25% set up fee for all decorations??? 25% of what....my wedding package?\n\nIf any of you could tell me what you&#039;ve experienced so far with the planning process that would be great!! :D\n\nThank you so much,\nMichelle[\/quote]Welcome and Congrats Michelle:) This site is extremely helpful in the planning process. I have over two years to wait and I&#039;m a tad overwhelmed.","Attachments":[],"Id":1841902,"PostDate":1396364796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>mpietsch, on 01 April 2014 - 01:44 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm new to the site and just wanted to say hello! I love reading all the posts. I know this is for 2014 weddings but I have mine booked at the Now Larimar for January 15, 2015! I can't wait. I am starting to get overwhelmed with the planning process. I did receive an email from my wedding coordinator Luisa with some basic information but I have sooooo many other questions!! Can any of you give me any advice? Right now I'm concerned about flower arrangements and decorations? We plan on bringing\u00a0ALOT of decorations down to DO. My wedding coordinator said they charge a 25% set up fee for all decorations??? 25% of what....my wedding package?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If any of you could tell me what you've experienced so far with the planning process that would be great!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much,<\/p>\n<p>Michelle<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Welcome and Congrats Michelle:) This site is extremely helpful in the planning process. I have over two years to wait and I'm a tad overwhelmed.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.64.84","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8961889241cea1c980d0957ca02cfa0e","RawContent":"@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] You&#039;re totally welcome. Just paying it forward because this site has made me so relaxed while planning mine! I am using Wright Travel Agency and our agents are so friggin helpful! They book the resort and airfare for my guests so I can avoid the same questions  and phone calls over and over. They&#039;ve saved me a ton of time so I can focus on other stuff, and they keep me updated with my guest count.","Attachments":[],"Id":1842016,"PostDate":1396430197,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> You're totally welcome. Just paying it forward because this site has made me so relaxed while planning mine! I am using Wright Travel Agency and our agents are so friggin helpful! They book the resort and airfare for my guests so I can avoid the same questions  and phone calls over and over. They've saved me a ton of time so I can focus on other stuff, and they keep me updated with my guest count. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":310,"NextPage":320,"PreviousPage":300,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
