{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de2ecd88fc4eecec7e96bf20a2ffeec5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] Do the guest have a payment plan option?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842020,"PostDate":1396432367,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> Do the guest have a payment plan option?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.66.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5e252b3549b600108b778f51869d4fa","RawContent":"@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] Sure do! $100 down to reserve the room and the remaining balance due 75 days before their travel date. My travel agent will email reminders to everyone about 2 weeks before that deadline. Airfare is due in full though if the guests book it through the TA.","Attachments":[],"Id":1842088,"PostDate":1396452638,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> Sure do! $100 down to reserve the room and the remaining balance due 75 days before their travel date. My travel agent will email reminders to everyone about 2 weeks before that deadline. Airfare is due in full though if the guests book it through the TA.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1396458339,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f28bb8718ddaaa959886aa422873a9c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I thought I would share a few photos of my wedding in January so you can see the Bridal Suite and fountain location. I do not have all of my professional photos back yet (only up to processional during ceremony), so if I get back more that show the ceremony, reception, and party better I will upload more!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope these help.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kristina&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":27276,"Name":"Bridal Suite.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-38499000-1396474229.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-38499000-1396474229_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":27277,"Name":"Bridal Suite 2.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-34638700-1396474250.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-34638700-1396474250_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":27278,"Name":"Bridal Suite 3.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-42601500-1396474284.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-42601500-1396474284_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":27279,"Name":"Hair.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-81170600-1396474954.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-81170600-1396474954_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27280,"Name":"Spa.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-72058000-1396475084.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-72058000-1396475084_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27281,"Name":"Dresses.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-87297900-1396475174.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-87297900-1396475174_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27282,"Name":"Fountain.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-57615500-1396475226.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-57615500-1396475226_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27283,"Name":"Fountain 2.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-35465200-1396475337.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-35465200-1396475337_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27284,"Name":"Guitarist 2.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-78461300-1396475394.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-78461300-1396475394_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27285,"Name":"Decor.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-60521900-1396475438.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-60521900-1396475438_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27286,"Name":"Decor 3.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-40291900-1396475570.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-40291900-1396475570_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27287,"Name":"Decor 2.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-48202300-1396475622.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-48202300-1396475622_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27288,"Name":"Toast.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-01208800-1396475683.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-01208800-1396475683_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27289,"Name":"Sand Ceremony.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-59534700-1396475728.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-59534700-1396475728_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27290,"Name":"Groomsmen Gift.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-02410500-1396475789.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-02410500-1396475789_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27291,"Name":"Bride &amp; Groom.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-40552800-1396475831.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-40552800-1396475831_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":27292,"Name":"Dance floor.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-82687600-1396475865.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-82687600-1396475865_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":27293,"Name":"Fire Dancer.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-67535500-1396475889.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264243-0-67535500-1396475889_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750}],"Id":1842116,"PostDate":1396458110,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I thought I would share a few photos of my wedding in January so you can see the Bridal Suite and fountain location. I do not have all of my professional photos back yet (only up to processional during ceremony), so if I get back more that show the ceremony, reception, and party better I will upload more!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope these help.<\/p>\n<p>Kristina<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357849978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7fba5561e190b3bc99169a702ae6e5ee","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Kristina Simms\" post=\"1842116\" timestamp=\"1396476110\"]\nHello ladies,\n\nI thought I would share a few photos of my wedding in January so you can see the Bridal Suite and fountain location. I do not have all of my professional photos back yet (only up to processional during ceremony), so if I get back more that show the ceremony, reception, and party better I will upload more!\n\nHope these help.\nKristina[\/quote]How do we view the photos?\n\n@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] Thank you so much:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1842199,"PostDate":1396510833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kristina Simms, on 02 April 2014 - 05:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I thought I would share a few photos of my wedding in January so you can see the Bridal Suite and fountain location. I do not have all of my professional photos back yet (only up to processional during ceremony), so if I get back more that show the ceremony, reception, and party better I will upload more!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope these help.<\/p>\n<p>Kristina<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>How do we view the photos?<\/p><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> Thank you so much:)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41925e4f9cfddb9cfb51e34805c124db","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m not sure how you can view the pics except by downloading them (with the 150 post status). When I previewed the post the pics showed up.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know how to add the pics so that they are visible without each person needing to DL them?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842259,"PostDate":1396532101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> \u00a0I'm not sure how you can view the pics except by downloading them (with the 150 post status). When I previewed the post the pics showed up.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone know how to add the pics so that they are visible without each person needing to DL them?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357849978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.244.62.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb13822de8a8e357fde0d83a8df9e229","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Looking for simple ideas for table decorations? &amp;nbsp; I think we have covered the decorations for the beach ceremony, but i am struggling with what to do for the beach reception. &amp;nbsp;Have any of you seen pictures for a beach reception? &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;BTW, for any bride getting married there after 7\/25\/14, i will have several decorations that I can leave behind with the wedding coordinator. &amp;nbsp;My mom is a florist and she is doing the silk flower \"balls\" that hang on the &amp;nbsp;shepherd hooks that go along the isle for the ceremony. &amp;nbsp; They are different shades of coral.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842376,"PostDate":1396559863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Looking for simple ideas for table decorations? \u00a0 I think we have covered the decorations for the beach ceremony, but i am struggling with what to do for the beach reception. \u00a0Have any of you seen pictures for a beach reception? \u00a0 \u00a0BTW, for any bride getting married there after 7\/25\/14, i will have several decorations that I can leave behind with the wedding coordinator. \u00a0My mom is a florist and she is doing the silk flower \"balls\" that hang on the \u00a0shepherd hooks that go along the isle for the ceremony. \u00a0 They are different shades of coral.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bellaezra@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.155.89.30","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392653308,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276751.jpg?_r=1392688284","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bellaezra","Id":276751,"Name":"Bellaezra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddres