{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09ad1444b9fb7881f44467011fd2ab9e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danamarielouise\"] congrats:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843044,"PostDate":1396868637,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276863\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276863-danamarielouise\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danamarielouise<\/span><\/a> congrats:)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"147.126.210.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26d55eb7dd0c8feec0a4994f6f528c8f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Bellaezra\"] Congrats on your wedding! I&#039;m getting married on October 18, 2014 and my colors are coral as well. Please post pics if you can. I would really like to see them. I love the look of the silk flower balls.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] I heard you said that your travel agent renegotiated your prices the more people you added. So did she start off by giving you a discount and do you get a discount towards the end once everybody is completely paid in full?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843190,"PostDate":1396949224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276751-bellaezra\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bellaezra<\/span><\/a> Congrats on your wedding! I'm getting married on October 18, 2014 and my colors are coral as well. Please post pics if you can. I would really like to see them. I love the look of the silk flower balls.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> I heard you said that your travel agent renegotiated your prices the more people you added. So did she start off by giving you a discount and do you get a discount towards the end once everybody is completely paid in full?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsconner1983@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.173.180.132","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362996207,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267190.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jahanee Conner","Id":267190,"Name":"Jahanee Conner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"147.126.210.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca49ad8d0985323eaa3eb1f433889aaa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is my attempt at my passport wedding invitation with the help of Vanessa &#039;s passport template. I seen the idea and I thought I would try it out!! I&#039;m very pleased on how they turned out!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sorry ladies I&#039;m trying to send them so you can be able to see them, even when you don&#039;t have the download capabilities!! I hope this helps&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-93589100-1396969418_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-93589100-1396969418_thumb.\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-77317800-1396969667_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-77317800-1396969667_thumb.\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-67959200-1396969437_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-67959200-1396969437_thumb.\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-75549000-1396969654_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-75549000-1396969654_thumb.\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-36235400-1396969692_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-36235400-1396969692_thumb.\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-86616500-1396969703_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-86616500-1396969703_thumb.\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-28938500-1396969721_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-28938500-1396969721_thumb.\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-26700900-1396969735_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-26700900-1396969735_thumb.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843204,"PostDate":1396952476,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is my attempt at my passport wedding invitation with the help of Vanessa 's passport template. I seen the idea and I thought I would try it out!! I'm very pleased on how they turned out!\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>Hi Ladies\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry ladies I'm trying to send them so you can be able to see them, even when you don't have the download capabilities!! I hope this helps<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-93589100-1396969418_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-93589100-1396969418_thumb.\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-77317800-1396969667_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-77317800-1396969667_thumb.\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-67959200-1396969437_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-67959200-1396969437_thumb.\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-75549000-1396969654_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-75549000-1396969654_thumb.\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-36235400-1396969692_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-36235400-1396969692_thumb.\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-86616500-1396969703_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-86616500-1396969703_thumb.\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-28938500-1396969721_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-28938500-1396969721_thumb.\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/monthly_04_2014\/post-267190-0-26700900-1396969735_thumb.jpeg.jpg\" alt=\"post-267190-0-26700900-1396969735_thumb.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsconner1983@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.173.180.132","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362996207,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267190.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jahanee Conner","Id":267190,"Name":"Jahanee Conner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c56d7b1a991b52650b4b671077fa5e5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Jahanee Conner\"] My TA actually started out working with Now on different types of room&amp;nbsp;prices and promotions. She sent me a spreadsheet with the different types of rooms and nightly rates for my group.&amp;nbsp;I ultimately signed an agreement in August last year to book at least&amp;nbsp;6 rooms with the promotion of \"book 5 rooms and get the 6th one free\", where the \"free\" room credit will go towards my account. I decided that we were safe with reserving 20 rooms, which included a combination of Deluxe Tropical View and Preferred Tropical View Rooms. Those filled up after a few months, so I talked with my TA about reserving more. Now because I signed a contract and reserved only 20 rooms at a specific rate, I was not guaranteed that the additional rooms I wanted to reserve&amp;nbsp;would be at the same rate. But my TA contacted the resort and got me more&amp;nbsp;rooms and was able to keep the same&amp;nbsp;room price that I&#039;d reserved months before! This was awesome to me because I know that the closer you get to a travel&amp;nbsp;date the more expensive the rooms become. The resort could have charged premium rates for last minute guests but&amp;nbsp;I secured more rooms at the group&amp;nbsp;rate I got last August!&amp;nbsp;Hope this explains more!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843413,"PostDate":1397038365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"267190\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/267190-jahanee-conner\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jahanee Conner<\/span><\/a> My TA actually started out working with Now on different types of room\u00a0prices and promotions. She sent me a spreadsheet with the different types of rooms and nightly rates for my group.\u00a0I ultimately signed an agreement in August last year to book at least\u00a06 rooms with the promotion of \"book 5 rooms and get the 6th one free\", where the \"free\" room credit will go towards my account. I decided that we were safe with reserving 20 rooms, which included a combination of Deluxe Tropical View and Preferred Tropical View Rooms. Those filled up after a few months, so I talked with my TA about reserving more. Now because I signed a contract and reserved only 20 rooms at a specific rate, I was not guaranteed that the additional rooms I wanted to reserve\u00a0would be at the same rate. But my TA contacted the resort and got me more\u00a0rooms and was able to keep the same\u00a0room price that I'd reserved months before! This was awesome to me because I know that the closer you get to a travel\u00a0date the more expensive the rooms become. The resort could have charged premium rates for last minute guests but\u00a0I secured more rooms at the group\u00a0rate I got last August!\u00a0Hope this explains more!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f6b127cad07d288a3520351bae3970a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Paolalindsay\" post=\"1764715\" timestamp=\"1370453163\"]\nHi again Amy...do you have Facebook? My wedding albums are public on FB so you can view them...I have a ton on there you can view....NOt all of them but about 400 +[\/quote]I would like to see your photos. What is your facebook name?\n\n@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] How soon did you start working with the TA? My wedding isn&#039;t until 2016. But, I would love to get the ball rolling.","Attachments":[],"Id":1843423,"PostDate":1397041296,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Paolalindsay, on 05 June 2013 - 12:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi again Amy...do you have Facebook? My wedding albums are public on FB so you can view them...I have a ton on there you can view....NOt all of them but about 400 +<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I would like to see your photos. What is your facebook name?<\/p><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> How soon did you start working with the TA? My wedding isn't until 2016. But, I would love to get the ball rolling.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b0140eb647cf1ed205cbeb6f6240e86","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] I know how you feel! As soon as I got engaged in mid-May 2013, I had a TA helping me out in mid-June! I looked for a TA early because we needed help in deciding what resort was best for us. We already had the destination in mind but there are soooo many resorts in the Dominican Republic to choose from. We know pricing for the rooms and wedding pricing were our main worries, so we had them do&amp;nbsp;the research and contact resorts that we were thinking about, and tell us the price the resorts were willing to give our group. I&#039;d say it doesn&#039;t hurt to shop around now for one because it could take some time (it took me a few weeks).&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843476,"PostDate":1397052333,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> I know how you feel! As soon as I got engaged in mid-May 2013, I had a TA helping me out in mid-June! I looked for a TA early because we needed help in deciding what resort was best for us. We already had the destination in mind but there are soooo many resorts in the Dominican Republic to choose from. We know pricing for the rooms and wedding pricing were our main worries, so we had them do\u00a0the research and contact resorts that we were thinking about, and tell us the price the resorts were willing to give our group. I'd say it doesn't hurt to shop around now for one because it could take some time (it took me a few weeks).<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a210d43dd85b2d44bc3c5c8b1c90af7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] I want to use the Wright Agency. People seem to really like them:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843493,"PostDate":1397054767,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> I want to use the Wright Agency. People seem to really like them:)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1397056680,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"401e056c153ec49b94cfe789a19b2466","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s who I&#039;m using! And so far so good!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843503,"PostDate":1397056646,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That's who I'm using! And so far so good!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35034b533771fe1090e438343d5135b3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you for all the tips:)@[member=\"duchovny0901\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843506,"PostDate":1397058021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you for all the tips:)@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\