> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.108.174.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8f8c3f9f09d32e0ebb9bf1ef827ad6b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Feath07\" post=\"1854111\" timestamp=\"1402017052\"]\n@[member=\"deelirious\"] Thanks for the info.  very useful and great to know!\n\n@[member=\"Tiffany Ellison\"] great post! So helpful, thanks!\n\n@[member=\"Tiffany Ellison\"]  if you don&#039;t mind me asking, how many guests did you end up having?[\/quote]\nThere were just 11 of us!","Attachments":[],"Id":1854113,"PostDate":1401999514,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Feath07, on 05 June 2014 - 08:10 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275995\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275995-deelirious\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deelirious<\/span><\/a> Thanks for the info. \u00a0very useful and great to know!<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271235\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271235-tiffany-ellison\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Tiffany Ellison<\/span><\/a> great post! So helpful, thanks!<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271235\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271235-tiffany-ellison\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Tiffany Ellison<\/span><\/a> \u00a0if you don't mind me asking, how many guests did you end up having?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There were just 11 of us!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"telli26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.91.162.106","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373111270,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":139,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tiffany Ellison","Id":271235,"Name":"Tiffany Ellison","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bad4ea0e6594d4390506d65080019bf5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Tiffany Ellison\"] Thanks so much for your review! I am also getting married at the fountains on August 30 and I was wondering where the cocktail hour would be held! I just had a few questions if you don&#039;t mind:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did you pick your own dinner menu? (did you select items from both the silver and the platinum dinner menus?)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did your coordinator print a menu for your group?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What did you do for music during cocktail hour (if any)?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What type of package did you book with the on-site photographers, and how long did they stay with you (start time and finish time)? I was wondering how much of the reception they capture in their packages. I may have to rely on friends and family for pics (like @[member=\"DestiBride\"] !)&amp;nbsp;during the later part of the evening but I&#039;m not sure if I can! LOL&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your help, and Congrats to you and your new&amp;nbsp;hubby!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1854215,"PostDate":1402079955,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271235\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271235-tiffany-ellison\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Tiffany Ellison<\/span><\/a> Thanks so much for your review! I am also getting married at the fountains on August 30 and I was wondering where the cocktail hour would be held! I just had a few questions if you don't mind:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you pick your own dinner menu? (did you select items from both the silver and the platinum dinner menus?)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did your coordinator print a menu for your group?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What did you do for music during cocktail hour (if any)?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What type of package did you book with the on-site photographers, and how long did they stay with you (start time and finish time)? I was wondering how much of the reception they capture in their packages. I may have to rely on friends and family for pics (like @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271242\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271242-destibride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DestiBride<\/span><\/a> !)\u00a0during the later part of the evening but I'm not sure if I can! LOL<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for your help, and Congrats to you and your new\u00a0hubby!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.147.104.166","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7fc30824ff8dd4be6c0174d6ae1a597c","RawContent":"Oh also to any past brides, what did you and your guests do after the reception?  We are planning to go to the nightclub on the resort and was wondering how the vibe is in there!","Attachments":[],"Id":1854270,"PostDate":1402160118,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh also to any past brides, what did you and your guests do after the reception?  We are planning to go to the nightclub on the resort and was wondering how the vibe is in there!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.188.148.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e0bfe0c4785be13b593948fa1adda1c","RawContent":"Past brides: I am getting married at the sister site, Now Jade IN September,  but planning my free stay for next year, reviews on Now Larimar as a vacation spot? Food? Service?  Thank you! \n\n\nBest of luck brides (: xoxo\n\n\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1854289,"PostDate":1402180839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Past brides: I am getting married at the sister site, Now Jade IN September,  but planning my free stay for next year, reviews on Now Larimar as a vacation spot? Food? Service?  Thank you! <br><br>\nBest of luck brides (: xoxo<br><br>\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">trishhh. <\/span><3\u00a0<span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">Now Jade, 09.23.2014<\/span>","Email":"patricia_ladd@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.186.69.44","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382730874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274569.jpg?_r=1402198559","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"A7Xtrish","Id":274569,"Name":"A7Xtrish","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.108.174.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a065839cf7dc45f9661c82a5abf0a863","RawContent":"[quote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1854270\" timestamp=\"1402178118\"]\nOh also to any past brides, what did you and your guests do after the reception? We are planning to go to the nightclub on the resort and was wondering how the vibe is in there![\/quote]\nOur group went to the nightclub on the resort every night!\nWe went after our reception and danced for probably 2 hours! I didn&#039;t want to change out of my dress so it was HOT for me! But still so much fun!","Attachments":[],"Id":1854297,"PostDate":1402219027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>duchovny0901, on 07 June 2014 - 04:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Oh also to any past brides, what did you and your guests do after the reception? We are planning to go to the nightclub on the resort and was wondering how the vibe is in there!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our group went to the nightclub on the resort every night!<\/p>\n<p>We went after our reception and danced for probably 2 hours! I didn't want to change out of my dress so it was HOT for me! But still so much fun!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"telli26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.91.162.106","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373111270,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":139,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tiffany Ellison","Id":271235,"Name":"Tiffany Ellison","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab3d784af034a280b11e23b48a5ed579","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks @[member=\"Tiffany Ellison\"]! That&#039;s great to hear.&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m trying to save cash and not extend the reception for longer than we have to!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1854341,"PostDate":1402243857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271235\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271235-tiffany-ellison\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Tiffany Ellison<\/span><\/a>! That's great to hear.\u00a0I'm trying to save cash and not extend the reception for longer than we have to!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.172.26.221","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3953bc08b8fc4303eaffed0ec13e0f8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1854270\" timestamp=\"1402178118\"]\nOh also to any past brides, what did you and your guests do after the reception?  We are planning to go to the nightclub on the resort and was wondering how the vibe is in there![\/quote]We extended the reception at Castaways till midnight and then around twelve of us hung out on the beach and swam in the ocean for another couple of hours. My husband and I ran into the ocean in our wedding clothes, others took their clothes off and went in in their underwear. It was soooo much fun. Just happened organically, though, wasn&#039;t planned.\n\nWe went to the nghtclub on other nights and it was fun too. The DJ is good and it&#039;s not too packed so if you&#039;re with a group you&#039;ll be able to stay together and find your own area to hang out in.\n[quote name=\"A7Xtrish\" post=\"1854289\" timestamp=\"1402198839\"]\nPast brides: I am getting married at the sister site, Now Jade IN September,  but planning my free stay for next year, reviews on Now Larimar as a vacation spot? Food? Service?  Thank you! \nBest of luck brides (: xoxo\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk[\/quote]Food and service were great and I would recommend it as a vacation spot. We were there from May 14-22 and it wasn&#039;t too packed. There were enough people that it was a fun and energetic vibe but it never felt crowded and we never had to wait in line for anything. We paid for the upgrade to \"preferred\" rooms but I didn&#039;t think it was worth it in the end. They don&#039;t really keep tabs on who&#039;s preferred and who&#039;s not so you could get away with using the preferred amenities if you wanted to, without being a member.","Attachments":[],"Id":1854344,"PostDate":1402247656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>duchovny0901, on 07 June 2014 - 04:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Oh also to any past brides, what did you and your guests do after the reception?  We are planning to go to the nightclub on the resort and was wondering how the vibe is in there!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nWe extended the reception at Castaways till midnight and then around twelve of us hung out on the beach and swam in the ocean for another couple of hours. My husband and I ran into the ocean in our wedding clothes, others took their clothes off and went in in their underwear. It was soooo much fun. Just happened organically, though, wasn't planned.<br><br>\nWe went to the nghtclub on other nights and it was fun too. The DJ is good and it's not too packed so if you're with a group you'll be able to stay together and find your own area to hang out in.<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>A7Xtrish, on 07 June 2014 - 10:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Past brides: I am getting married at the sister site, Now Jade IN September,  but planning my free stay for next year, reviews on Now Larimar as a vacation spot? Food? Service?  Thank you! <br>\nBest of luck brides (: xoxo<br>\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nFood and service were great and I would recommend it as a vacation spot. We were there from May 14-22 and it wasn't too packed. There were enough people that it was a fun and energetic vibe but it never felt crowded and we never had to wait in line for anything. We paid for the upgrade to \"preferred\" rooms but I didn't think it was worth it in the end. They don't really keep tabs on who's preferred and who's not so you could get away with using the preferred amenities if you wanted to, without being a member.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tamika_nicole@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.129.78.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373129531,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271242.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DestiBride","Id":271242,"Name":"DestiBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.29.211.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b155fc664b1461e91b683e2c7e270447","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies! &amp;nbsp;I just got back from our 9 night stay at NOW Larimar and it was nothing short of perfect!!!! &amp;nbsp;I would be happy to share anything about our experience, but I will not be checking this site regularly (and I don&#039;t really know how to work it) so please email me ANY questions you might have! bethlorentz@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The basics of our wedding:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Fountain wedding on June 6, 2014 at 5pm&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Hair and make up were done by members of the spa staff&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Reception by the relaxing pool from 7-10&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Silver buffet dinner&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-35 guests&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Luisa was my wedding coordinator&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Outside photographer (Caribbean Emotions - Michael and Pascal)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Welcome party on the beach&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-No cocktail hour&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Resort DJ&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Brought almost all of my own decorations and artificial flowers&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Look forward to helping how I can! &amp;nbsp;Congrats to all of &amp;nbsp;you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855149,"PostDate":1402676798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies! \u00a0I just got back from our 9 night stay at NOW Larimar and it was nothing short of perfect!!!! \u00a0I would be happy to share anything about our experience, but I will not be checking this site regularly (and I don't really know how to work it) so please email me ANY questions you might have! bethlorentz@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The basics of our wedding:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-Fountain wedding on June 6, 2014 at 5pm<\/p>\n<p>-Hair and make up were done by members of the spa staff<\/p>\n<p>-Reception by the relaxing pool from 7-10<\/p>\n<p>-Silver buffet dinner<\/p>\n<p>-35 guests<\/p>\n<p>-Luisa was my wedding coordinator<\/p>\n<p>-Outside photographer (Caribbean Emotions - Michael and Pascal)<\/p>\n<p>-Welcome party on the beach<\/p>\n<p>-No cocktail hour<\/p>\n<p>-Resort DJ<\/p>\n<p>-Brought almost all of my own decorations and artificial flowers<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Look forward to helping how I can! \u00a0Congrats to all of \u00a0you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bethlorentz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.88.29.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375533315,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272212.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bethlorentz","Id":272212,"Name":"bethlorentz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"451b1edb86794b6f520c8645aab982ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My wedding is booked of May 21st, 2015! I am very excited, and am now starting to look if I should use outside vendors vs the resort services?   I have looked into having Krystie Ann do my make up as I think I really would like it airbrushed.&amp;nbsp; What are your views on the resort photography and decorations?&amp;nbsp; Did a lot of you use an oustide decorator?&amp;nbsp; It is so overwhelming trying to decide whether to use the resort or outside services!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, I think I am going to have my ceremony at the fountain as I would like it a little more private.&amp;nbsp; Did anyone use the eclispe terrace for the ceremony?&amp;nbsp; My wedding coordinator told me it may be more private.&amp;nbsp; Also did anyone use the ballroom for their reception?&amp;nbsp; I heard that would be more private as well!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much- any advice is greatly appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856058,"PostDate":1403119681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My wedding is booked of May 21st, 2015! I am very excited, and am now starting to look if I should use outside vendors vs the resort services?\u00a0\u00a0 I have looked into having Krystie Ann do my make up as I think I really would like it airbrushed.\u00a0 What are your views on the resort photography and decorations?\u00a0 Did a lot of you use an oustide decorator?\u00a0 It is so overwhelming trying to decide whether to use the resort or outside services!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, I think I am going to have my ceremony at the fountain as I would like it a little more private.\u00a0 Did anyone use the eclispe terrace for the ceremony?\u00a0 My wedding coordinator told me it may be more private.\u00a0 Also did anyone use the ballroom for their reception?\u00a0 I heard that would be more private as well!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much- any advice is greatly appreciated!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388147078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.147.104.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8cfc52019ac8b3ac2f4b92ad7da3466","RawContent":"@[member=\"Cwright\"] congratulations on your upcoming wedding! I&#039;m getting married this August and decided to do a fountain ceremony due to privacy as well. All the pics I&#039;ve seen of ceremonies held there are awesome, especially because there&#039;s no one photo bombing the pics in their bikinis!  Hahaha! I am booking the ballroom as well due to privacy but also because we can party up til midnight with a large group.  I looked into the eclipse terrace at first but when my party became so huge, ot wasn&#039;t a possibility. Plus the time schedule didnt fit (club opens at 1030pm) and I didn&#039;t want my reception cut short. The only thing with the ballroom is that I heard its super plain, like a meeting room, so you might have to jazz it up with decor. we&#039;re bringing almost everything down to decorate!\n\n\nHope this helps and happy planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1856067,"PostDate":1403123293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275744\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cwright<\/span><\/a> congratulations on your upcoming wedding! I'm getting married this August and decided to do a fountain ceremony due to privacy as well. All the pics I've seen of ceremonies held there are awesome, especially because there's no one photo bombing the pics in their bikinis!  Hahaha! I am booking the ballroom as well due to privacy but also because we can party up til midnight with a large group.  I looked into the eclipse terrace at first but when my party became so huge, ot wasn't a possibility. Plus the time schedule didnt fit (club opens at 1030pm) and I didn't want my reception cut short. The only thing with the ballroom is that I heard its super plain, like a meeting room, so you might have to jazz it up with decor. we're bringing almost everything down to decorate!<br><br>\nHope this helps and happy planning! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":370,"NextPage":380,"PreviousPage":360,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
