{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"876e7de2fc66a47b31bb84b7a35d5720","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI Duchovny9091!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your upcoming wedding! Thanks so much for the reply!&amp;nbsp; I have been seeing more and more pics of the fountain and loving it!   I still can&#039;t decided between the ballroom and castaways!&amp;nbsp; I am worried about castaways with the heat- at least the ballroom is air conditioned!&amp;nbsp; Are you using the resort photographers?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856826,"PostDate":1403643634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI Duchovny9091!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your upcoming wedding! Thanks so much for the reply!\u00a0 I have been seeing more and more pics of the fountain and loving it!\u00a0\u00a0 I still can't decided between the ballroom and castaways!\u00a0 I am worried about castaways with the heat- at least the ballroom is air conditioned!\u00a0 Are you using the resort photographers?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388147078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7399265c921c4d9fa54292a4d476433d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cwright&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Thanks and no problem! I had the same dilemma; since our wedding is going to be during one of the hottest times of the year I figured I&#039;d just play it safe. Plus the hubby pretty much sweats just by&amp;nbsp;breathing (lol) so that wouldn&#039;t look too great in pics! We did decide to use the resort photographers (WBA)&amp;nbsp;to save the $500 vendor fee. Our wedding package comes with ceremony pics and video, so we are&amp;nbsp;going to pay&amp;nbsp;for a photo shoot after the ceremony. We&amp;nbsp;are debating on the \"getting ready\" pics though,&amp;nbsp;because WBA charges $150 for 10 photos of the groom getting ready so we are really trying to see if its worth it. We will have audience participation for the reception and have them post pics to a wedding app. I&#039;ve heard other brides do this&amp;nbsp;and since we have over 80 people coming, someone&#039;s bound to take good photos!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856846,"PostDate":1403682241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>Cwright<\/span><\/a>\u00a0Thanks and no problem! I had the same dilemma; since our wedding is going to be during one of the hottest times of the year I figured I'd just play it safe. Plus the hubby pretty much sweats just by\u00a0breathing (lol) so that wouldn't look too great in pics! We did decide to use the resort photographers (WBA)\u00a0to save the $500 vendor fee. Our wedding package comes with ceremony pics and video, so we are\u00a0going to pay\u00a0for a photo shoot after the ceremony. We\u00a0are debating on the \"getting ready\" pics though,\u00a0because WBA charges $150 for 10 photos of the groom getting ready so we are really trying to see if its worth it. We will have audience participation for the reception and have them post pics to a wedding app. I've heard other brides do this\u00a0and since we have over 80 people coming, someone's bound to take good photos!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6ec34a23a575c7c5fae2508b3da8598","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@duchovny9091 I think I may just use their photography too!&amp;nbsp; $150 does seem like a lot to photograph the groom getting ready- not like they have too much to do haha!&amp;nbsp; I was possibly going to look at some outside prices but everything adds up so quickly!&amp;nbsp; I would like to save the $500 vendor fee as well! That is amazing you have so many guests going!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone had their reception at Castaways in May?&amp;nbsp; Was it too hot?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857645,"PostDate":1404162297,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@duchovny9091 I think I may just use their photography too!\u00a0 $150 does seem like a lot to photograph the groom getting ready- not like they have too much to do haha!\u00a0 I was possibly going to look at some outside prices but everything adds up so quickly!\u00a0 I would like to save the $500 vendor fee as well! That is amazing you have so many guests going!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone had their reception at Castaways in May?\u00a0 Was it too hot?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388147078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.176.20.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0257a4f5b0315c626eb03347e399ff71","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Getting married at NOW Larimar 2\/25\/15 at the fountain with reception at the Relaxing Pool.&amp;nbsp; Any feedback from anyone who has already had their wedding or done a site visit on the fountain, pool, or&amp;nbsp;had a reception at the Eclipse Night Club?&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I are debating because I really like the idea of doing the reception at the night club for a couple reasons...comfortable seating at sofas and chairs out in the open air so people can mingle and relax.&amp;nbsp; Unless I&#039;m wrong, the pool&amp;nbsp;has pool chairs and the tables\/chairs set up for the reception itself&amp;nbsp;only.&amp;nbsp; There will likely be people travelling through the pool area, thus giving less&amp;nbsp;privacy.&amp;nbsp;The night club&amp;nbsp;is still covered in the event of inclement weather.&amp;nbsp; Does the night club have a nice view?&amp;nbsp; Any input would be very much appreciated.&amp;nbsp; Hopefully I&#039;m posting this properly!!&amp;nbsp; Don&#039;t just see an option for a new post, only a reply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858099,"PostDate":1404390767,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Getting married at NOW Larimar 2\/25\/15 at the fountain with reception at the Relaxing Pool.\u00a0 Any feedback from anyone who has already had their wedding or done a site visit on the fountain, pool, or\u00a0had a reception at the Eclipse Night Club?\u00a0 \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance and I are debating because I really like the idea of doing the reception at the night club for a couple reasons...comfortable seating at sofas and chairs out in the open air so people can mingle and relax.\u00a0 Unless I'm wrong, the pool\u00a0has pool chairs and the tables\/chairs set up for the reception itself\u00a0only.\u00a0 There will likely be people travelling through the pool area, thus giving less\u00a0privacy.\u00a0The night club\u00a0is still covered in the event of inclement weather.\u00a0 Does the night club have a nice view?\u00a0 Any input would be very much appreciated.\u00a0 Hopefully I'm posting this properly!!\u00a0 Don't just see an option for a new post, only a reply.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"numbersguy75@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.176.20.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404385864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278818.jpg?_r=1404404162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"numbersguy75","Id":278818,"Name":"numbersguy75","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e721c114fbd5ef2e42198921859967e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Just a little&amp;nbsp;info to&amp;nbsp;brides that are flying into Punta Cana after November 14, 2014: If you haven&#039;t purchased your airline tix yet, Southwest starts flying international! I found this out a few weeks ago and WISH they did this earlier in the year. I&#039;m a fan of their reasonable airfare and their 2 free checked&amp;nbsp;bags per person&amp;nbsp;policy. This would&#039;ve saved us some money considering we have at least 2 large bags between us and have to pay for each one, and we&#039;re giving stuff to our guests to carry too! If all of your guests fly Southwest, you could basically carry all of your wedding items for free! Hopefully someone&#039;s able to use this for their wedding travel!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858973,"PostDate":1404997834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Just a little\u00a0info to\u00a0brides that are flying into Punta Cana after November 14, 2014: If you haven't purchased your airline tix yet, Southwest starts flying international! I found this out a few weeks ago and WISH they did this earlier in the year. I'm a fan of their reasonable airfare and their 2 free checked\u00a0bags per person\u00a0policy. This would've saved us some money considering we have at least 2 large bags between us and have to pay for each one, and we're giving stuff to our guests to carry too! If all of your guests fly Southwest, you could basically carry all of your wedding items for free! Hopefully someone's able to use this for their wedding travel!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.133.139.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be0a4201a2fc8e27af8c245e6ccde866","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Everyone!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I too am very excited to have found this site as I begin preparations for my wedding in Feb 2015!!&amp;nbsp; I haven&#039;t touched bases with my coordinator and really didn&#039;t know that I should be the first to contact her until reading this website. So, I am thankful I googled for reviews and found this site!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860180,"PostDate":1405520764,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Everyone!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I too am very excited to have found this site as I begin preparations for my wedding in Feb 2015!!\u00a0 I haven't touched bases with my coordinator and really didn't know that I should be the first to contact her until reading this website. So, I am thankful I googled for reviews and found this site!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsdtaylor910@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.133.139.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1378116019,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273127.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Drnelly910","Id":273127,"Name":"Drnelly910","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.118.235.238","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"843ed7e7dcd4d350c5c0a725d95d9767","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m getting married on 5\/16\/15 at the fountain and I have a few questions. &amp;nbsp;I love the wooden plank walkway but I don&#039;t want to pay $1500 for it. &amp;nbsp;I would rather save that to splurge on our honey moon. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m just worried that it will look weird walking down the side of the fountain. &amp;nbsp;Does anyone have any pictures of the bride or wedding party walking down the side of the fountain that I can see? &amp;nbsp;Any previous brides that walked down the side of the fountain that have any insight? &amp;nbsp;I would love to hear your thoughts. &amp;nbsp;Soooo glad I found this site...it&#039;s been so helpful! &amp;nbsp;Good luck with all your planning ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860733,"PostDate":1405694660,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey everyone! \u00a0I'm getting married on 5\/16\/15 at the fountain and I have a few questions. \u00a0I love the wooden plank walkway but I don't want to pay $1500 for it. \u00a0I would rather save that to splurge on our honey moon. \u00a0I'm just worried that it will look weird walking down the side of the fountain. \u00a0Does anyone have any pictures of the bride or wedding party walking down the side of the fountain that I can see? \u00a0Any previous brides that walked down the side of the fountain that have any insight? \u00a0I would love to hear your thoughts. \u00a0Soooo glad I found this site...it's been so helpful! \u00a0Good luck with all your planning ladies!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccalightsey@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.190.197.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405536263,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279045.jpg?_r=1434956018","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"RebeLight","Id":279045,"Name":"RebeLight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.121.201.136","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d077e70c61b89cae7c4adf081721410","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Hi Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Congrats everyone on choosing the NOW. It&#039;s such a beautiful resort!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;I see a lot of you mentioning the topic of using the resort photographers vs an off site photographer. First and foremost, you have to LOVE LOVE LOVE your photographer!! I can&#039;t stress this enough. Your wedding images &amp;amp; videography (if you&#039;re doing that) are truly the 1 honest heirloom you&#039;ll have from your day. No matter who it is, make sure you absolutely adore what they do! If you&#039;d like to see a full wedding there from us, head here: {&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-emily-matt\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;http:\/\/www.shoeboxph...ing-emily-matt\/&lt;\/a&gt;} along with their romance session on the Now beach:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a&gt;{http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/punta-cana-sunrise-engagement-session-emily-matt\/}&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Also... we understand that the NOW has a pretty steep fee for using outside vendors so we offer to split this fee with you. :) Enjoy! &amp;amp; Happy planning beauties!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;amp; If you have any questions - photography related or not, give me a shout. I&#039;m happy to help. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;XO&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Mel&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860740,"PostDate":1405695771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Congrats everyone on choosing the NOW. It's such a beautiful resort!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">I see a lot of you mentioning the topic of using the resort photographers vs an off site photographer. First and foremost, you have to LOVE LOVE LOVE your photographer!! I can't stress this enough. Your wedding images & videography (if you're doing that) are truly the 1 honest heirloom you'll have from your day. No matter who it is, make sure you absolutely adore what they do! If you'd like to see a full wedding there from us, head here: {<a href='http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/now-larimar-punta-cana-wedding-emily-matt\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.shoeboxph...ing-emily-matt\/<\/a>} along with their romance session on the Now beach:\u00a0<a>{http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/punta-cana-sunrise-engagement-session-emily-matt\/}<\/a>\u00a0Also... we understand that the NOW has a pretty steep fee for using outside vendors so we offer to split this fee with you. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Enjoy! & Happy planning beauties!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">& If you have any questions - photography related or not, give me a shout. I'm happy to help. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">XO<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Mel<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div><img src=\"https:\/\/lh6.googleusercontent.com\/-lGVqCU0N1AM\/U8QTGSsNQLI\/AAAAAAAAAG8\/c2eMfpfUb98\/w900-h34-no\/Separator.png\" alt=\"Separator.png\"><\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.shoebox.photography'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh4.googleusercontent.com\/-JdsF2YCETJ4\/U8QTHoSz6AI\/AAAAAAAAAHI\/Gs0gmfxN6yg\/w900-h208-no\/Signature+Image.png\" alt=\"Signature+Image.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/blog\/'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/-rTlCZicS2NI\/U8QTLPp1YfI\/AAAAAAAAAHw\/Qvck2GcSFVU\/s32-no\/Blog.png\" alt=\"Blog.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ShoeBoxPhotography.ca'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh4.googleusercontent.com\/-uxRk32WMQoc\/U8QTLKwy4DI\/AAAAAAAAAH4\/pRWW6OhEkKM\/s32-no\/Facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/plus.google.com\/+ShoeBoxPhotographyCoquitlam'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-TMGooLPDMy4\/U8QTLLPlm0I\/AAAAAAAAAHs\/w6eJlxhiJAU\/s32-no\/Google%252B.png\" alt=\"Google%252B.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/instagram.com\/shoeboxphoto'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/-ajJLgsJxa04\/U8QTLbzmXVI\/AAAAAAAAAHo\/NrvofXeyI7Q\/s32-no\/Instagram.png\" alt=\"Instagram.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/sbxphotography'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-vJoZFBKe3io\/U8QTLmkl-RI\/AAAAAAAAAHg\/WIjIkkyfuP8\/s32-no\/Pinterest.png\" alt=\"Pinterest.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.twitter.com\/ShoeBox_Photo'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-7rLyHZHERXc\/U8QTL3MkRzI\/AAAAAAAAAHk\/L-CoCkcA8rw\/s32-no\/Twitter.png\" alt=\"Twitter.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:hello@shoebox.photography?subject=BDW%20Message'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh4.googleusercontent.com\/-hOjdlMEtFy4\/U8QTGcV0rrI\/AAAAAAAAAHA\/_nX5zB9A7z0\/w264-h43-no\/Let%2527s+Chat+arrow+and+button.png\" alt=\"Let%2527s+Chat+arrow+and+button.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"hello@shoebox.photography","IpAddress":"181.37.93.247","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1401786398,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278221.png?_r=1402507848","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ShoeBoxPhotography","Id":278221,"Name":"ShoeBoxPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.55.104.78","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2a20eca307557caaf5ce45693243017","RawContent":"Hi Everyone,\n\n\nI&#039;m sorry if this has been asked but 39 pages of posts is too long to read!  I want to book Anna Nuet for my wedding.  Did anyone book her? If so was a day pass sufficient or did they charge you the $500 outside vendor fee.  I don&#039;t mind paying the day pass but $500 is not in my budget! Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":1860963,"PostDate":1405792924,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Everyone,<br><br>\nI'm sorry if this has been asked but 39 pages of posts is too long to read!  I want to book Anna Nuet for my wedding.  Did anyone book her? If so was a day pass sufficient or did they charge you the $500 outside vendor fee.  I don't mind paying the day pass but $500 is not in my budget! Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alicia_mc17@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.227.136.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396255656,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"AandG","Id":277414,"Name":"AandG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.55.104.78","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b0c780da8559c6d9b5bbedfa12e87d5","RawContent":"Past brides- has anyone used the resort DJ?  How was it?  Wondering if its worth paying the extra fee for DJ Mannia or not.  Any input is appreciated!","Attachments":[],"Id":1861358,"PostDate":1405973619,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Past brides- has anyone used the resort DJ?  How was it?  Wondering if its worth paying the extra fee for DJ Mannia or not.  Any input is appreciated! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alicia_mc17@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.227.136.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396255656,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"AandG","Id":277414,"Name":"AandG","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":380,"NextPage":390,"PreviousPage":370,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
