Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57cbc1bc92f6579e31b67e04ac2c6d97","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;OK I finally uploaded my wedding album! &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/1drv.ms\/1tIAX1i&#039;&gt;http:\/\/1drv.ms\/1tIAX1i&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Make sure that you:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1) Sort by Name (Ascending)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2) Click on the Details view Icon&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3) Click on first picture title (should be wbaphoto 01)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This way you can scroll through pics in chronological order AND get an idea of WBA&#039;s work. I did put a few pics that were taken by my friends in the mix. Hope you guys&amp;nbsp;enjoy! Let me know if you have any questions!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;NOTES:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- We had 79 adults and 9 children. We had the Divine Package.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- We were married at the fountain of the resort at 4pm. Added the $1,500 wooden walkway upgrade&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Cocktail hour was held at the Eclipse nightclub (supposed to be the garden but it rained an hour before the wedding and&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;  grass was soggy. My WC Luisa actually gave us this option or the hallways of the ballroom).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Reception was held in the ballroom. We used their centerpieces (sent them pics of what we wanted)&amp;nbsp;and upgraded to tiffany chairs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- DJ service was DJ Mannia. We used this company&#039;s DJ\/MC Service and their white wooden dance floor. The bubbles and sparklers were not ordered; they just did it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- The tall oversized men just so \"happened\" to be in the hallway of the ballrooms and just stopped in to say hi! Unplanned and hilarious!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best day of my life for sure!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871629,"PostDate":1410531169,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>OK I finally uploaded my wedding album! <a href='http:\/\/1drv.ms\/1tIAX1i' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/1drv.ms\/1tIAX1i<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Make sure that you:<\/p>\n<p>1) Sort by Name (Ascending)<\/p>\n<p>2) Click on the Details view Icon<\/p>\n<p>3) Click on first picture title (should be wbaphoto 01)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This way you can scroll through pics in chronological order AND get an idea of WBA's work. I did put a few pics that were taken by my friends in the mix. Hope you guys\u00a0enjoy! Let me know if you have any questions!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>NOTES:<\/p>\n<p>- We had 79 adults and 9 children. We had the Divine Package.<\/p>\n<p>- We were married at the fountain of the resort at 4pm. Added the $1,500 wooden walkway upgrade<\/p>\n<p>- Cocktail hour was held at the Eclipse nightclub (supposed to be the garden but it rained an hour before the wedding and\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0grass was soggy. My WC Luisa actually gave us this option or the hallways of the ballroom).<\/p>\n<p>- Reception was held in the ballroom. We used their centerpieces (sent them pics of what we wanted)\u00a0and upgraded to tiffany chairs.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- DJ service was DJ Mannia. We used this company's DJ\/MC Service and their white wooden dance floor. The bubbles and sparklers were not ordered; they just did it!<\/p>\n<p>- The tall oversized men just so \"happened\" to be in the hallway of the ballrooms and just stopped in to say hi! Unplanned and hilarious!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best day of my life for sure!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.185.63.62","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1410544764,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91bf241f6bfd6416d2cd5725e54fe4bf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi duchovny0901&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations !! , wish you the best !!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mannia Cancun-Punta Cana&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871643,"PostDate":1410544736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi duchovny0901<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations !! , wish you the best !!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Mannia Cancun-Punta Cana<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.manniacancun.com.mx'>DJ SERVICE CANCUN ,RIVIERA MAYA ,MX , PUNTA CANA D.R.<br \/>\nhttp:\/\/www.manniacancun.com.mx<\/a>","Email":"carlosmartinez@manniacancun.com.mx","IpAddress":"187.153.96.158","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1238551140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216337.jpg?_r=1393909989","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DJMannia","Id":216337,"Name":"DJMannia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.188.148.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2dde8d1868c007cdc7ea66673d571bef","RawContent":"\u2661\u2661\u2661","Attachments":[],"Id":1871660,"PostDate":1410560484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \u2661\u2661\u2661\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">trishhh. <\/span><3\u00a0<span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">Now Jade, 09.23.2014<\/span>","Email":"patricia_ladd@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.186.69.44","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382730874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274569.jpg?_r=1402198559","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"A7Xtrish","Id":274569,"Name":"A7Xtrish","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"147.126.190.40","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7dc6943f8fd38cecbcf80c5cbbb5cdd7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] Your pics are amazing!! You looked absolutely stunning!! I see that you said that you got your centerpieces through the resort were they expensive. I&#039;m not sure what I want to do as far as centerpieces, since I&#039;m already bring so much stuff down with me already.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872050,"PostDate":1410941282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> Your pics are amazing!! You looked absolutely stunning!! I see that you said that you got your centerpieces through the resort were they expensive. I'm not sure what I want to do as far as centerpieces, since I'm already bring so much stuff down with me already.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsconner1983@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.173.180.132","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362996207,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267190.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jahanee Conner","Id":267190,"Name":"Jahanee Conner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3d2bd8903058bdfd2afc9b885c40d63","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Jahanee Conner\"] Thanks so much!!!!! I did get the centerpieces through the resort because just like you, I had too much stuff to pack and carry down there! It was&amp;nbsp;a last minute decision to use their centerpieces.&amp;nbsp;I&#039;d sent my WC ideas for flower centerpieces and she quoted me as high as $285 each! Not happening. So we went with a different flower arrangement which was&amp;nbsp;about half that,&amp;nbsp;still on the expensive side. One option you can do which she told me is that you can rent the vases they have there and just bring the items that you want in them. For example, I saw a centerpiece on Pinterest where there was a square glass vase that had those fake limes in them, then pretty fake flowers to top it off.&amp;nbsp;I think to rent the vase from the resort&amp;nbsp;it was quoted as $10 each.&amp;nbsp;Hope this helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872109,"PostDate":1410963227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"267190\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/267190-jahanee-conner\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jahanee Conner<\/span><\/a> Thanks so much!!!!! I did get the centerpieces through the resort because just like you, I had too much stuff to pack and carry down there! It was\u00a0a last minute decision to use their centerpieces.\u00a0I'd sent my WC ideas for flower centerpieces and she quoted me as high as $285 each! Not happening. So we went with a different flower arrangement which was\u00a0about half that,\u00a0still on the expensive side. One option you can do which she told me is that you can rent the vases they have there and just bring the items that you want in them. For example, I saw a centerpiece on Pinterest where there was a square glass vase that had those fake limes in them, then pretty fake flowers to top it off.\u00a0I think to rent the vase from the resort\u00a0it was quoted as $10 each.\u00a0Hope this helps!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.12.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b4e9c81a1927218b1cc11f8ac41b348","RawContent":"Hello ladies.  I&#039;m definitely loving this topic as I recently got engaged and we are thinking of a July 2015 wedding.  The now was recommended by a travel agent but from reviews on trip advisor I&#039;m thinking twice about. Can you please share your experiences, advice, pics anything you can think of with me.... please this has been overwhelming and with having less than a year I need to get moving on this.","Attachments":[],"Id":1872139,"PostDate":1410977403,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies.  I'm definitely loving this topic as I recently got engaged and we are thinking of a July 2015 wedding.  The now was recommended by a travel agent but from reviews on trip advisor I'm thinking twice about. Can you please share your experiences, advice, pics anything you can think of with me.... please this has been overwhelming and with having less than a year I need to get moving on this. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jparedes1215@aol.com","IpAddress":"172.56.12.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410973055,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"joacevedo15","Id":279880,"Name":"joacevedo15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06dd6b389be25dcc852389db7d1307ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"joacevedo15\"] Congrats on your engagement! This forum has been the BEST source of info in helping to plan my wedding, and I&#039;m hoping to give back any info and advice that I can! I had a&amp;nbsp;phenomenal time at Now. The service was outstanding. The food was great. The grounds are clean and well kept. Our&amp;nbsp;room was amazing (my hubby and I had the Oceanfront&amp;nbsp;Master Suite). I&amp;nbsp;think in terms of helping make your decision, an important factor to me was&amp;nbsp;considering what deal the resort could offer me and my large group for staying at their resort. My TA was able to do the work for me; contact the resorts we were interested in and they all gave us quotes and a promotion detail (like if you book 5 rooms your 6th is free). Now gave us the best rates and the wedding packages and locations at the resort were impressive.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At Now our guests had Deluxe Tropicalview rooms (Preferred and non-preferred) which they all enjoyed. The only thing with that is that although \"Preferred\" guests are supposed to get specific amenities (like certain pools and restaurants) it appeared no one was checking if you were actually perferred or not.&amp;nbsp;At the preferred pool and restaurant (Castaways), our non-preferred&amp;nbsp;guests walked in and hung out with us the whole time.&amp;nbsp;So save the money and stick with the regular rooms since you won&#039;t be in there half the time anyway!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I attached a link to pics from my wedding at Now a few posts back. You can get an idea of what the grounds look like as well as decor options and WBA&#039;s work. Honestly I felt like this was my perfect wedding day and it was better than I could have imagined! Feel free to ask any questions!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872175,"PostDate":1411033462,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279880\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279880-joacevedo15\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">joacevedo15<\/span><\/a> Congrats on your engagement! This forum has been the BEST source of info in helping to plan my wedding, and I'm hoping to give back any info and advice that I can! I had a\u00a0phenomenal time at Now. The service was outstanding. The food was great. The grounds are clean and well kept. Our\u00a0room was amazing (my hubby and I had the Oceanfront\u00a0Master Suite). I\u00a0think in terms of helping make your decision, an important factor to me was\u00a0considering what deal the resort could offer me and my large group for staying at their resort. My TA was able to do the work for me; contact the resorts we were interested in and they all gave us quotes and a promotion detail (like if you book 5 rooms your 6th is free). Now gave us the best rates and the wedding packages and locations at the resort were impressive.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At Now our guests had Deluxe Tropicalview rooms (Preferred and non-preferred) which they all enjoyed. The only thing with that is that although \"Preferred\" guests are supposed to get specific amenities (like certain pools and restaurants) it appeared no one was checking if you were actually perferred or not.\u00a0At the preferred pool and restaurant (Castaways), our non-preferred\u00a0guests walked in and hung out with us the whole time.\u00a0So save the money and stick with the regular rooms since you won't be in there half the time anyway!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I attached a link to pics from my wedding at Now a few posts back. You can get an idea of what the grounds look like as well as decor options and WBA's work. Honestly I felt like this was my perfect wedding day and it was better than I could have imagined! Feel free to ask any questions!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371505464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ce22c81ce228966223364e96a86f84e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"duchovny0901\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations!!!!! You looked stunning, and everything looked AAMMMAAAZZZINNGGG!!! &amp;nbsp;Two questions: 1. did you rent the bridal suite? 2. did you request the purple and white bouquets?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872239,"PostDate":1411051979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations!!!!! You looked stunning, and everything looked AAMMMAAAZZZINNGGG!!! \u00a0Two questions: 1. did you rent the bridal suite? 2. did you request the purple and white bouquets?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375995069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.150.236.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1411054171,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3feddad3a6f732bfac556f4e5872b620","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"duchovny0901\"] Omg love love love your pictures. It def helps to see real pictures instead of the ones the site provides. I stayed at the Now Jade in Rivera Maya last month and it was not a bad hotel but def not a place I would go back to I guess maybe that was another issue of mine in deciding on the now larimarbut your pics did sawy me towards this place. I have sooo many questions on well everything, lol. Maybe I will start with seeing if they even have the date we have planned available maybe then I can bombard you with questions. Yikes this is a lot to take in. Glad I have you ladies to get advice from. I do have a quesiton is there a place with a great view for pics I&#039;m from Chicago so views mean a lot to me.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872246,"PostDate":1411054114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a> Omg love love love your pictures. It def helps to see real pictures instead of the ones the site provides. I stayed at the Now Jade in Rivera Maya last month and it was not a bad hotel but def not a place I would go back to I guess maybe that was another issue of mine in deciding on the now larimarbut your pics did sawy me towards this place. I have sooo many questions on well everything, lol. Maybe I will start with seeing if they even have the date we have planned available maybe then I can bombard you with questions. Yikes this is a lot to take in. Glad I have you ladies to get advice from. I do have a quesiton is there a place with a great view for pics I'm from Chicago so views mean a lot to me.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jparedes1215@aol.com","IpAddress":"172.56.12.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410973055,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"joacevedo15","Id":279880,"Name":"joacevedo15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.150.236.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88c9819c70367c093f6c8fb13c54d694","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know if they perform weddings on Sundays? I was just informed by a travel agent that they don&#039;t. Seems odd.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872251,"PostDate":1411058212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does anyone know if they perform weddings on Sundays? I was just informed by a travel agent that they don't. Seems odd.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jparedes1215@aol.com","IpAddress":"172.56.12.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410973055,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"joacevedo15","Id":279880,"Name":"joacevedo15","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":465,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":410,"NextPage":420,"PreviousPage":400,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
