> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79705,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1446611597,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9033bd400053cbacd470b7cabe0c0e4","RawContent":"Today felt like a horrible nightmare that I keep hoping I&#039;m going to wake up from.\n\n\nWe&#039;ve had our wedding booked for April 9th at the Ocean Coral &amp;amp; Turquesa for past last 4 months.  We&#039;ve been beyond excited.. created cool website with pics... printed invites &amp;amp; save the dates.. Just really fell in love with the property (sans seaweed issues :-)\n\n\nBut found out today that the travel agent we&#039;ve been working with didn&#039;t hold the rooms (and didn&#039;t inform us on how important and urgent it was to put them on hold) and now the entire hotel is full.  No Vacancy.  Sold out until the day after our wedding.  \n\n\nI&#039;m not typically a \"drama mama\" but today, I&#039;m Totally Freaking Out!\n\n\nWe need to find another 3.5 to 5star all-inclusive venue in PDC, with a similar price point, that&#039;s available on April 9th (or worse case senario, the 10th).  And can also accommodate 40-60 rooms for our guests.\n\n\nHelp!  Fellow Brides &amp;amp; wedding angels... I need a Miracle\u2728\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\u2728  Milagro :-)  Any suggestions or quick tips you can offer are warmly welcomed!","Attachments":[],"Id":1907122,"PostDate":1446611263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Today felt like a horrible nightmare that I keep hoping I'm going to wake up from.<br><br>\nWe've had our wedding booked for April 9th at the Ocean Coral & Turquesa for past last 4 months.  We've been beyond excited.. created cool website with pics... printed invites & save the dates.. Just really fell in love with the property (sans seaweed issues :-)<br><br>\nBut found out today that the travel agent we've been working with didn't hold the rooms (and didn't inform us on how important and urgent it was to put them on hold) and now the entire hotel is full.  No Vacancy.  Sold out until the day after our wedding.  <br><br>\nI'm not typically a \"drama mama\" but today, I'm Totally Freaking Out!<br><br>\nWe need to find another 3.5 to 5star all-inclusive venue in PDC, with a similar price point, that's available on April 9th (or worse case senario, the 10th).  And can also accommodate 40-60 rooms for our guests.<br><br>\nHelp!  Fellow Brides & wedding angels... I need a Miracle\u2728\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\u2728  Milagro :-)  Any suggestions or quick tips you can offer are warmly welcomed!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jeffandshauna2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435382211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283718.png?_r=1446004687","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":152,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SparkyM","Id":283718,"Name":"SparkyM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79705,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ad0a0f765960c1648ac71dd2c6fe739","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh no! This is why it is so important to work with an agent that specializes in weddings.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you want to reach out to us at info@wrighttravelagency.com we can go over some options.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;April is such a tough time because of spring break&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907142,"PostDate":1446639259,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh no! This is why it is so important to work with an agent that specializes in weddings.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you want to reach out to us at info@wrighttravelagency.com we can go over some options.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>April is such a tough time because of spring break<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG'><strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137206220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79705,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b69b3fb57574c552599b308accac2ef","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SparkyM\" post=\"1907122\" timestamp=\"1446629263\"]\nToday felt like a horrible nightmare that I keep hoping I&#039;m going to wake up from.\n\nWe&#039;ve had our wedding booked for April 9th at the Ocean Coral &amp;amp; Turquesa for past last 4 months. We&#039;ve been beyond excited.. created cool website with pics... printed invites &amp;amp; save the dates.. Just really fell in love with the property (sans seaweed issues :-)\n\nBut found out today that the travel agent we&#039;ve been working with didn&#039;t hold the rooms (and didn&#039;t inform us on how important and urgent it was to put them on hold) and now the entire hotel is full. No Vacancy. Sold out until the day after our wedding.\n\nI&#039;m not typically a \"drama mama\" but today, I&#039;m Totally Freaking Out!\n\nWe need to find another 3.5 to 5star all-inclusive venue in PDC, with a similar price point, that&#039;s available on April 9th (or worse case senario, the 10th). And can also accommodate 40-60 rooms for our guests.\n\nHelp! Fellow Brides &amp;amp; wedding angels... I need a Miracle\u2728\u2728 Milagro :-) Any suggestions or quick tips you can offer are warmly welcomed![\/quote]@[member=\"SparkyM\"],\n\nOH MY WORD!! Im sure wright travel will be able to sort you out in no time. you will soon be putting this behind you and enjoying  your wedding.\n\n\nHappy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1907155,"PostDate":1446669981,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SparkyM, on 04 November 2015 - 04:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Today felt like a horrible nightmare that I keep hoping I'm going to wake up from.<br><br>\nWe've had our wedding booked for April 9th at the Ocean Coral & Turquesa for past last 4 months. We've been beyond excited.. created cool website with pics... printed invites & save the dates.. Just really fell in love with the property (sans seaweed issues :-)<br><br>\nBut found out today that the travel agent we've been working with didn't hold the rooms (and didn't inform us on how important and urgent it was to put them on hold) and now the entire hotel is full. No Vacancy. Sold out until the day after our wedding.<br><br>\nI'm not typically a \"drama mama\" but today, I'm Totally Freaking Out!<br><br>\nWe need to find another 3.5 to 5star all-inclusive venue in PDC, with a similar price point, that's available on April 9th (or worse case senario, the 10th). And can also accommodate 40-60 rooms for our guests.<br><br>\nHelp! Fellow Brides & wedding angels... I need a Miracle\u2728\u2728 Milagro :-) Any suggestions or quick tips you can offer are warmly welcomed!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283718\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283718-sparkym\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SparkyM<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>OH MY WORD!! Im sure wright travel will be able to sort you out in no time. you will soon be putting this behind you and enjoying \u00a0your wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79705,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1446672594,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31ca381ac5a34db78ac2c98f50955451","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dreamweddings\" post=\"1907155\" timestamp=\"1446687981\"]\n@[member=\"SparkyM\"],\n\nOH MY WORD!! Im sure wright travel will be able to sort you out in no time. you will soon be putting this behind you and enjoying  your wedding.\n\n\nHappy Planning![\/quote][quote name=\"TammyWright\" post=\"1907142\" timestamp=\"1446657259\"]\nOh no! This is why it is so important to work with an agent that specializes in weddings.\n\nIf you want to reach out to us at info@wrighttravelagency.com we can go over some options.\n\nApril is such a tough time because of spring break[\/quote]#thingsIknowNowandWishIhadKnownBefore :-( \n\nI&#039;m NOW working with Babs so I know all will be well. We got leads on 2 properties today.  Fingers crossed....\n\nTHANK YOU SO MUCH @[member=\"TammyWright\"] for creating this Brilliant site!!!   I only wish I had found it sooner.  \n[quote name=\"dreamweddings\" post=\"1907155\" timestamp=\"1446687981\"]\n@[member=\"SparkyM\"],\n\nOH MY WORD!! Im sure wright travel will be able to sort you out in no time. you will soon be putting this behind you and enjoying  your wedding.\n\n\nHappy Planning![\/quote]Thank you Joyce at @[member=\"dreamweddings\"] !  I&#039;m working with Babs NOW so fingers crossed it all works out in the end.  In the meantime, cheers to beers &amp;amp; wine-ing :-)  \np.s. LOVE your website and your amazing &#039;energy&#039; &amp;amp; intention!  Totally shines through your site.  It&#039;s evident that you&#039;re all about Love &amp;amp; Contribution &amp;lt;3","Attachments":[],"Id":1907158,"PostDate":1446672109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dreamweddings, on 04 November 2015 - 08:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283718\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283718-sparkym\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SparkyM<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>OH MY WORD!! Im sure wright travel will be able to sort you out in no time. you will soon be putting this behind you and enjoying \u00a0your wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TammyWright, on 04 November 2015 - 12:14 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Oh no! This is why it is so important to work with an agent that specializes in weddings.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you want to reach out to us at info@wrighttravelagency.com we can go over some options.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>April is such a tough time because of spring break<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>#thingsIknowNowandWishIhadKnownBefore :-(\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm NOW working with Babs so I know all will be well. We got leads on 2 properties today. \u00a0Fingers crossed....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>THANK YOU SO MUCH @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"206696\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammywright\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TammyWright<\/span><\/a> for creating this Brilliant site!!! \u00a0 I only wish I had found it sooner. \u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dreamweddings, on 04 November 2015 - 08:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283718\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283718-sparkym\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SparkyM<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>OH MY WORD!! Im sure wright travel will be able to sort you out in no time. you will soon be putting this behind you and enjoying \u00a0your wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you Joyce at @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a> ! \u00a0I'm working with Babs NOW so fingers crossed it all works out in the end. \u00a0In the meantime, cheers to beers & wine-ing :-) \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>p.s. LOVE your website and your amazing 'energy' & intention! \u00a0Totally shines through your site. \u00a0It's evident that you're all about Love & Contribution <3\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jeffandshauna2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435382211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283718.png?_r=1446004687","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":152,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SparkyM","Id":283718,"Name":"SparkyM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79705,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0912a9e1390103c03d81ffa2ee4dfd0d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"dreamweddings\"] is a superstar&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907159,"PostDate":1446672720,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n          